ar-item se-toolbar-item-separator-bar\" data-role=\"button-container\">\u003Cdiv data-type=\"separator-bar\" data-name=\"separator-bar\" class=\"se-separator-bar-button se-toolbar-button-separator-bar\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-icon\">\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/li>\u003Cli class=\"se-toolbar-item se-toolbar-item-speller\" data-role=\"button-container\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" title=\"\" class=\"se-speller-toolbar-button se-property-toolbar-basic-button __se-sentry\" data-group=\"propertyToolbar\" data-type=\"basic\" data-name=\"speller\" data-log=\"prt.spl\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-icon\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">맞춤법\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-tooltip\">맞춤법\u003C/span>\u003C/button>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-progressbar\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-blind\">로딩중.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/header> \u003Cdiv class=\"se-container\">\u003Cdiv id=\"drag-ghost\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-content __se-scroll-target\">\u003Csection class=\"se-canvas se-canvas-width-886 se-l-viewport-tablet se-l-viewport-desktop se-theme-default se-native-selection-hidden\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-content-guide\">\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-selection\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">\u003Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"se-caret se-caret-drop\" style=\"display:none;top:0;left:0;width:0;height:0\" focusable=\"false\">\n                   \u003Crect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\u003C/rect>\n               \u003C/svg>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-caret\" style=\"display: none; top: 1010px; left: 944.5px; width: 2px; height: 19px;\">\n                    \u003Cspan class=\"se-caret-ai-icon\">\n                \u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"se-caret se-is-caret-blinking\" style=\"top: 1010px; left: 944.5px; width: 1px; height: 19px;\" focusable=\"false\">\n                   \u003Crect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\u003C/rect>\n               \u003C/svg>\u003Csvg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"se-selection-block\" style=\"top:0px;left:0px;width:0px;height:0px\" focusable=\"false\">\n                   \u003Crect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\u003C/rect>\n               \u003C/svg>\u003C/div>\u003Carticle class=\"se-components-wrap\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-documentTitle se-l-default\" id=\"SE-6f39c15f-3f5f-4813-85a8-328e22a4423c\" data-compid=\"SE-6f39c15f-3f5f-4813-85a8-328e22a4423c\" data-a11y-title=\"제목\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv draggable=\"false\" class=\"se-section se-section-documentTitle se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-5b377a91-6f0b-4d3d-8adf-ad8542668933\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-title-text se-module-fs32-min-height-for-ie\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-52f63b15-c2c1-4879-9607-cfa0a53966bd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c0758661-8577-48b3-803d-97fd0274ce30\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs32 __se-node\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-placeholder __se_placeholder se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs32\">제목\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-button-wrap\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-attach-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-local-image-upload\" title=\"내 컴퓨터에서 배경사진 첨부\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-sns-image-upload\" title=\"MYBOX에서 배경사진 불러오기\">\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-edit-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-set-position\" title=\"제목 배경사진 위치 이동\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">위치이동\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-del-image\" title=\"제목 배경 사진 삭제\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">제목 배경 사진 삭제\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-moving-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-discard-position\" title=\"위치 이동 취소\">취소\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-confirm-position\" title=\"위치 이동 저장\">확인\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-bd1a97f0-6e9b-4082-be65-7e189ba3f9a8\" data-compid=\"SE-bd1a97f0-6e9b-4082-be65-7e189ba3f9a8\" data-a11y-title=\"본문\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-bd1a97f0-6e9b-4082-be65-7e189ba3f9a8\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-308374d4-f16a-4515-8ea0-d4c5e326f224\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-9f6586f2-e75c-4216-b2a2-f4699d509d8d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8ccc1435-ec08-454a-84db-9f7b6394bc37\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c93b1ded-6803-438c-8479-42bd8bf9d8c9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5dd2950e-2786-44d8-852a-c2e6baee0173\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://%EC%B0%B8%EC%86%8C%EC%8B%9D.com\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>더 많은 소식이 궁금하다면 참소식 포켓 뉴스에서 확인해보시겠어요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ae5c3b00-5f9c-4cfa-ba85-6f36e5c753a7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-735c2e2f-98a0-44ba-bcb6-3dd78d03a1fe\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6925c3d8-b6bf-4ae2-9fa8-ac409882b30b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-43cc59fb-aa72-4127-96b5-de86aff7066c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 ‘전쟁·지정학·글로벌 경제 불확실성’이 커지는 요즘, 환율 변동 위험을 최소화하고 장기적·안정적인 투자 시스템을 구축하는 것이 무엇보다 중요합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a052541f-e300-4f89-93c8-4f780a7e4bfe\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8%20%EB%B3%80%EB%8F%99%20%EC%9C%84%ED%97%98%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A4%91%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>환율 변동 위험은 왜 중요한가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-278b577d-5989-4604-bceb-080a919ba01b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f0438f1e-ad8b-42d7-a29f-cba0f7489f3f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 최근 국제 정세 악화와 금리 상승, 원·달러·엔 변동성이 급증하면서 투자 환경이 크게 흔들리고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dd801ff9-677e-4b2b-8ccb-74d26e464fb4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8%20%EB%B3%80%EB%8F%99%20%EC%99%9C%20%ED%98%84%EC%9E%AC%20%EC%A4%91%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 지금 환율 변동이 이슈가 되나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4e61bef6-ca04-40a1-8ac4-517969d073da\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f5dcb1eb-7328-448e-aa99-8a6baf7ac81e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 제공된 Mermaid 흐름도는 다양한 투자·거래 활동이 지정학 리스크와 어떻게 연결되는지를 한눈에 보여줍니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-11ce1198-5e34-4e74-aaf5-9cbaf08cbfa6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=Mermaid+%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%84%EB%8F%84%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%97%B0%EA%B2%B0\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>Mermaid 흐름도가 투자와 어떻게 연결되나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bb20b109-d7f0-406a-937b-c1dd6ba482d3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e39b0827-7a6d-4a08-bf55-dc1a206ca4d0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b 전쟁·국제 갈등 → 안전통화와 위험자산의 스프레드 확대, 글로벌 경기 침체 우려 → 금리·통화 변동, 디지털 자산 변동성 → 가격 거품 위험이 동시에 나타납니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b69e41f2-b6ac-44f9-878a-17b08b7994ba\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A0%84%EC%9F%81%20%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8%20%EC%8A%A4%ED%94%84%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C%20%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%80%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%9C%A0\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>전쟁이 환율 스프레드에 미치는 영향은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a56a05a7-87e6-4449-a09b-187b18d384e3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-22c51296-da53-492a-a620-b93536a7d6af\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 현재 눈에 띄는 트렌드로는 디지털 자산 변동성 확대, 고배당·자동 투자 확대, 인프라·AI·로봇 시장 성장, 레버리지·청산 위험 증가가 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-de44b002-b61d-41e4-9746-3eea7acd7318\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%94%94%EC%A7%80%ED%84%B8%20%EC%9E%90%EC%82%B0%20%EB%B3%80%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%20%ED%98%84%ED%99%A9\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>디지털 자산 변동성은 어떻게 변하고 있나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-52ba146a-b398-45b5-9bb8-4d9f53d3120d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-940be87a-b4b7-426f-8505-e73db87cae7a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 이제 투자자가 실천해야 할 5가지 액션 플랜을 제시합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c27eb138-c712-4156-a7f8-ec7bb3752e5c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%95%A1%EC%85%98%20%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%9C%205%EA%B0%80%EC%A7%80\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>투자 액션 플랜 5가지는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b442def8-e22e-44ac-9e5a-89075012280d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a2b61bf3-6e3f-43a8-8f9a-d386eb50d412\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 환율 헤지 전략 확대 \u2013 선물·옵션을 활용해 USD/KRW, EUR/KRW 헤지 포지션을 구축하고 통화 ETF(예: FXI, UUP)로 포트폴리오 내 환위험을 분산합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c1a5dba9-c69f-4554-a3ee-7061ec788484\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8%20%ED%97%A4%EC%A7%80%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>환율 헤지 전략은 어떻게 세우나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-55c1c75b-0a8c-4a46-a27a-e4e8017aa917\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d93cd35c-c33f-4b6e-9476-4c4aabb155f2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2740 포트폴리오 구조 재조정 \u2013 방어(고배당·인프라·채권)와 성장(AI·로봇·인도 인프라) 비중을 70:30으로 맞춥니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-147c94be-4e70-4ed6-8ec4-b39c3b918407\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8%ED%8F%B4%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%20%EB%B0%A9%EC%96%B4%20%EC%84%B1%EC%9E%A5%20%EB%B9%84%EC%A4%91%20%EC%A1%B0%EC%A0%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>포트폴리오 방어·성장 비중은 어떻게 조정하나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-15ad4833-c7f6-40ae-a0e6-df99350b969f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-57c2f6d7-b006-419a-91ba-22ee06e897ab\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2741 자동화·정기투자 도입 \u2013 달러\u2011코스트\u2011에버리징(DCF) 방식으로 월 1~2% 자동 매수, 배당 재투자(DRIP)로 복리 효과를 높입니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7b062920-3617-4288-9932-cb67159e0a7b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%8B%AC%EB%9F%AC%20%EC%BD%94%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%EC%97%90%EB%B2%84%EB%A6%AC%EC%A7%95%20%EC%9E%90%EB%8F%99%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>달러 코스트 에버리징 자동투자는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9b9dbdd2-0e36-4633-b30d-55cdd70575df\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6794fabf-5f7d-442b-919c-8e8c7dc5a566\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742 정세 모니터링 체계 구축 \u2013 주간 ‘정세·경제 리포트’를 구독하고 전쟁·유가·금리 이벤트 시 리밸런싱 트리거(환율 변동 ±3%)를 설정합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f8f9235e-a6d4-4b08-8809-12ad852e66cc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A0%95%EC%84%B8%20%EB%AA%A8%EB%8B%88%ED%84%B0%EB%A7%81%20%EB%A6%AC%EB%B0%B8%EB%9F%B0%EC%8B%B1%20%ED%8A%B8%EB%A6%AC%EA%B1%B0%20%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>정세 모니터링 리밸런싱 트리거는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e3fb281a-f3b3-429d-8646-211f60e5a393\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1c18df47-5214-4193-8ab6-4a2fd1f55dae\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2743 리스크 시나리오 테스트 \u2013 전쟁·유가·금리 3가지 시나리오를 가정해 시뮬레이션하고 핵심 포지션 비중을 미리 정의해 급변 상황에 신속 대응합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5b0a4776-b37a-480e-8e67-112da8a7dbd4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%20%EC%8B%9C%EB%82%98%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%20%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>리스크 시나리오 테스트는 어떻게 하나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1ee3dad5-7c01-4de2-9aae-c323b4aa9b10\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a46a5651-ed2e-423f-ba66-2d45d7e1ded6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 불확실성 속에서도 ‘안정’이 가장 큰 투자 알파라는 점을 기억하시길 바랍니다. 환율 변동 위험을 최소화하고 장기적·안정적인 시스템을 구축하면 변동성에 휘말리지 않고 지속 가능한 수익을 만들 수 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fb789d4c-03dd-431a-a0c4-5cf09078a683\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B6%88%ED%99%95%EC%8B%A4%EC%84%B1%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%95%88%EC%A0%95%20%EC%95%8C%ED%8C%8C%20%EC%9D%98%EB%AF%B8\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>불확실성 속 투자 알파는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c0a114ae-e763-4fc4-b956-0fca27265960\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d6fb197b-aaaa-4d12-b263-4349bd4dd501\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dbc7b62c-6056-4080-b815-9820abe73155\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-01560929-2a41-40cf-962e-f857db980628\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">전쟁 지정학 환율 투자 안정성\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6bd60899-83ab-40d9-bbde-5626edddef98\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-060c2bee-1f33-4303-9e16-9f11ad9367d6\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\U0001f4ac\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c5f1e220-29d7-4909-886c-d5f27e0dddfc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu> K-POP / K-드라마 / 게임 트렌드 + 네이버 실시간 키워드 분석 + 자동화 커뮤니티\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-806915ed-900e-45b1-aec5-ba907ed9aac0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-pa