ph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-86a39124-0efe-4e07-bdaf-99ed9b50c90f\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bdbb442a-2a1c-406c-9b66-dca8308bca9d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-55646920-4db0-44a8-8778-c33638eda34f\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5eb16c43-424c-4979-bab8-aede1ed0f4bb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a4704d16-5605-4892-ab93-4c186b303a5e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c02ce258-28c4-41f5-8fc6-2e27cd65dd57\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-81017a0e-eba9-4d75-ba05-6c1b62dd40d1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>트렌드와 인사이트\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c34cb203-6225-4164-8881-00999148a6c9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-84c20e03-a4ee-45a8-948e-0bbc688c1503\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d94d98c5-39b7-4e8a-aea7-d69822926745\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f35f91a9-059f-49f7-a526-e23cf186b2e5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">- 회복·성장률은 2~3%지만, 중소기업 매출 성장률은 0.8%에 머물고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0225116c-63d5-490f-80e8-a91d9411219c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f30e89b0-6bc2-4fad-a3cd-e46b55bdf525\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"col