 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-853fe7a1-8f95-4e54-8f11-6c3995d0f302\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4c6a88c4-8f98-4bff-8e09-8bd646debb57\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f0e38dd2-56db-4019-94c2-b0a8f1403d1d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 뉴스 핵심 요약\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4cb9d05a-fe86-40eb-85e6-e393a397cc4c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cfb47311-f0dd-4888-9478-dd5922210c34\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 최근 부동산 가격 급등과 주식 투자 손실이 가계 재정을 억누르고 있어요. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-53d1feb6-c24d-4fd7-9678-27e3a61c52c4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B6%80%EB%8F%99%EC%82%B0%20%EA%B0%80%EA%B2%A9%20%ED%8F%AD%EB%93%B1%20%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%B8\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>부동산 가격 폭등의 원인이 궁금하신가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9651d3d2-e971-4dca-9233-99f4f1f4865c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-34aced3e-11ff-4723-8f9e-3e787e29827d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A3%BC%EC%8B%9D%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%8B%A4%ED%8C%A8%20%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%B8\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>주식 투자 실패 원인이 궁금하시죠?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dca890a2-9e60-4dac-88a3-8717d250cdf3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-42b78dc5-d9bf-4168-91e5-647e19b1cb39\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-14c6ac01-8508-4839-aef4-d4a4fb4b22b0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f97c77cc-e60e-42c2-96e4-d3bb62ba9a41\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b48a7513-6489-4875-945c-d8ef8bbd26be\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 흐름을 한눈에\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7d74d61a-123d-4e6f-8d4a-922c6a600fd3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ad8c2c52-e5ca-4dde-a116-62b3895053ab\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 부동산·주식 가격 상승 → 가계 부채 급증 → 생활고 심화 → 사회 문제 부각이라는 순환이 눈에 띄어요. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f179e298-5021-4f88-9680-a97c96030087\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B2%BD%EC%A0%9C%EC%A0%81%20%EC%A0%88%EB%A7%9D%20%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%84\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>경제적 절망 흐름을 확인해 보실래요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-af76e65d-ceec-495c-b6b1-e0bdad6986ab\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-43b8f368-36b6-49a6-9274-f70e7d9f349c\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e08860c1-49d4-47ab-85d5-803b1e114554\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7753655c-47e3-4738-95df-819537473724\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7edc0f0b-390d-467e-89b9-379f97e09e60\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 구조적 인사이트 &amp; 트렌드\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e36b3a7d-6c9d-4cec-82ec-c3d913822752\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5c542be7-840e-4203-adf0-4b653c78018a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 현재 가계 부채 비중은 사상 최고 수준이며, 소득·자산 격차가 크게 벌어지고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-379f73b3-fc09-4d0d-af7c-1ed0cb53aaa4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=2023+%EA%B0%80%EA%B3%84%EB%B6%80%EC%B1%84%20%ED%98%84%ED%99%A9\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>2023년 가계부채 현황을 살펴보세요\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5a4f0907-4fc7-4fdd-a5eb-7b6f607df557\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 또한 복지 비용 상승이 가계 부담을 가중시키고, ‘동네북’ 같은 비전문가 투자가 위험을 확대하고 있죠.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f261191f-7fc2-4957-a9d4-ff1fc18a867e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-193a58bb-0b87-4680-b228-9997cca814a6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-08993421-e8b0-4da3-9205-67e5efe7b0c6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e4e81196-bc59-4e52-9356-01dc8be9af96\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-85be7450-57d7-4c74-829c-919fa561b601\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 왜 지금이 전환점인가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-84e4061c-b937-4c13-97b9-1e8fffced3b4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9858a641-6de6-447e-be6e-e48a01314b3f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 가계 부채·자산 격차가 극에 달하면서 금융 위기 재발 위험이 커지고, 극단 선택 사례가 늘어나고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-56951f80-8a82-42e7-acd1-20d81f95818e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B7%B9%EB%8B%A8%20%EC%84%A0%ED%83%9D%20%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%80%20%EC%9B%90%EC%9D%B8\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>극단 선택 증가 원인을 확인해 보세요\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-84c51663-71df-4afd-b1c3-66240442c270\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 이런 상황은 사회 안전망의 미비와 직결돼요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cedb5a9b-a35d-41f0-8f70-cabf91723286\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a19d9538-3397-4510-aef3-70ccdbeb0d78\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c46bc52d-0829-4ebd-9e79-3471571974d8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b7af2f25-a911-4944-a5f8-8eaf688a40cc\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>5\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-22444097-01be-4ad1-b7ca-d8309664b5df\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 해결을 위한 제언\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-15f38632-3458-4d5c-85be-e5cab61a9a40\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7a634ffe-307a-4c88-bc7a-4826cc9af7ca\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b 첫째, 건보료·연금 구조조정을 통해 저소득·노년층을 위한 긴급 복지 지원을 확대해야 합니다. 둘째, ‘동네북’ 투자자를 위한 기초 금융 교육과 리스크 관리 프로그램을 늘려야 해요. 셋째, 공공주택·임대주택 공급을 확대하고 청년·신혼부부 맞춤형 대출을 재구조화해야 합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-13421671-8aab-4bf7-91dd-4e93be220361\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B3%B5%EA%B3%B5%EC%A3%BC%ED%83%9D%20%ED%99%95%EB%8C%80%20%EC%A0%95%EC%B1%85\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>공공주택 확대 정책을 보시겠어요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0dbca161-8b0f-4b89-a54f-76a366d98ad8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fc3a35ea-7a4f-4efe-ad25-6a774df56272\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d1a9c255-1d07-46d0-9181-3c9d9d5879d4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fc03f772-244b-4384-83eb-0e7ef278de2d\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>6\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0f4f035a-0085-493c-815e-71e44bb0753f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 마무리 \u2013 포용과 회복의 전환점\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2cc3e535-9636-4bdd-869a-9d724fab0a42\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8290794-4693-462d-956c-03af46269bd9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c 부동산·주식 폭등이 만든 가계 위기는 개인의 실수가 아니라 구조적 문제입니다. 이제는 ‘성장’보다 ‘포용과 회복’에 초점을 맞춰 전환점을 만들 차례예요. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a32263ee-9b69-40c9-b3cb-8c571149f681\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%8F%AC%EC%9A%A9%20%ED%9A%8C%EB%B3%B5%20%EC%A0%84%ED%99%98%EC%A0%90%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>포용·회복 전환점 전략을 찾아보세요\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0a4b0ac5-4905-4209-ba27-d0a3e67cc7a2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2f85da8e-3616-4bb8-a169-fc171e1955e1\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d8738bb2-6d43