tTitle se-l-default se-section-align-center\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-82e5bad1-c9f1-47fc-be6c-f7277d08e5ae\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit se-is-empty se-title-text se-module-fs32-min-height-for-ie\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-59b2ae22-b943-4337-a7f6-f28bb93159fd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b1059a36-b7a9-4b9c-b53a-e5168c050889\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs32 __se-node\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-placeholder __se_placeholder se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs32\">제목\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-button-wrap\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-attach-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-local-image-upload\" title=\"내 컴퓨터에서 배경사진 첨부\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-sns-image-upload\" title=\"MYBOX에서 배경사진 불러오기\">\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-edit-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-set-position\" title=\"제목 배경사진 위치 이동\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">위치이동\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-del-image\" title=\"제목 배경 사진 삭제\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">제목 배경 사진 삭제\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-moving-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-discard-position\" title=\"위치 이동 취소\">취소\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-confirm-position\" title=\"위치 이동 저장\">확인\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-3f452f8e-c257-4a99-be68-ce32d6ecad7e\" data-compid=\"SE-3f452f8e-c257-4a99-be68-ce32d6ecad7e\" data-a11y-title=\"본문\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-3f452f8e-c257-4a99-be68-ce32d6ecad7e\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-4321ccc9-9578-423e-8800-75d7395f46a6\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-36e949cf-c33e-4a75-8285-037e4dd88ce1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a88b21e9-5e93-49c6-b3b3-26739f9ef715\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-620b2ddb-1289-4d02-87da-db9104198076\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1c55c580-a5b8-49c2-a9f6-6ce6de7e0cf3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://%EC%B0%B8%EC%86%8C%EC%8B%9D.com\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>더 많은 소식이 궁금하다면 참소식 포켓 뉴스에서 확인해보시겠어요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-438aaa59-d85f-41d9-80f2-8b1aef81c77b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fbebbfba-ff70-442a-b2da-3fe8316ccd5d\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9d53bf07-8496-4264-917d-0f022e9359f2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-32edf224-641a-44b9-8a53-45fcce7eaf0b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 주식 시장은 언제나 비합리적이고 변동성이 큽니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3d1b250c-1cdb-490c-8a70-11fd390782e8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A3%BC%EC%8B%9D%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5%EC%9D%B4%20%EC%9D%B4%EB%A0%87%EA%B2%8C%20%EB%B3%80%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%EC%9D%B4%20%ED%81%B0%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 주식 시장이 이렇게 변동성이 큰가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bb12d32c-6317-4e97-96c4-425bbe733572\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-beea2b25-4705-4c0c-94fc-f64a240547d7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 비합리성을 활용하고, 공포가 팽배한 순간에 저가 매수하는 것이 투자 성공의 가장 큰 열쇠입니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ccc8a529-b342-4534-b15a-d9a340c7f131\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B3%B5%ED%8F%AC%20%EC%83%81%ED%99%A9%EC%97%90%EC%84%9C%20%EC%A0%80%EA%B0%80%20%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%EB%8A%94%20%EC%96%B4%EB%96%BB%EA%B2%8C%20%EA%B0%80%EB%8A%A5%ED%95%A0%EA%B9%8C\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>공포 상황에서 저가 매수는 어떻게 가능할까?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4a31a625-64d8-4fae-b6d1-e1916912eb85\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-238a599f-0ffd-4faf-990a-9e29a0bc073b\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5e4daa68-057e-414e-9f45-e5070450e4b5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dfa9e5d8-7aee-476f-842f-833948e1a87a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>시장 흐름\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a01dd195-c501-41e9-bfe7-55f992458400\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b9b3b624-66cd-4b56-9136-24af93c2bc4c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">시장은 기술주 부진 → 안전 자산 선호 → 은 수요 급증 → 전쟁 리스크 → 가격 폭등 → 경제·사회 어려움 순으로 이어지는 복합 구조를 가지고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-edb6bd32-bd80-4cd0-9a61-1c18f7e27fe0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A3%BC%EC%8B%9D%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5%20%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%84%20%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0%20%EC%84%A4%EB%AA%85\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>주식 시장 흐름을 어떻게 이해하나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-069d8e41-7084-4499-a3ff-780e6477e95a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c55b851d-f7e5-40ef-8b42-ba7e57bfaf7f\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ab02ef08-3d50-487d-b54f-6e9330f5cf48\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-04d16630-7a7b-4d78-972e-8cbf30537ef4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>왜 변동성을 활용해야 할까요?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-340d25a6-9ec0-4f4a-b704-818e8cb9606a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5d3d4233-6795-4a1a-bd57-71853e65ab81\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 변동성은 가격과 가치가 일시적으로 어긋나는 순간을 의미합니다. 이때가 바로 “가치 매수”의 최적 타이밍이죠. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ab856c18-4e12-48cc-9d9e-16c1576e61d2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B3%80%EB%8F%99%EC%84%B1%20%EC%8B%9C%EA%B8%B0%EC%97%90%20%EA%B0%80%EC%B9%98%20%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>변동성 시기에 가치 매수 방법은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1583117a-ec4a-408f-ba31-25ca701aca2e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b820f210-deac-476d-a99f-21c7e2e2d00f\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3ea4ddce-9659-47ee-98fa-44c75774b2af\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3e4ceb88-39ac-49a9-aa52-e478ed6f9449\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>구체적 전략\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-04d2daf0-2cf3-4173-8bad-a3823b4f69b5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fa51e92e-fdd1-4c45-b6e6-4bb5c4064cdd\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b18fcfd1-2455-45a4-9315-0799cf5a355c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 시장 심리 지표를 체크합니다. VIX, AAII 등 공포 지수가 30% 이상 상승하면 매수 후보를 탐색합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f6baa155-7754-4969-a3bd-a247309d2d74\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B3%B5%ED%8F%AC%20%EC%A7%80%EC%88%98%2030%25%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%83%81%20%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%A0%90\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>공포 지수가 30% 이상이면 어떻게 해야 할까?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e2654e15-4178-4c26-a5e9-60d985430dd3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-048baff2-5f44-4564-92f6-86a3fe34e6ea\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fc1b793c-8e9a-4471-8de9-0e4203197cd7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 섹터·자산별 과매도를 판단합니다. 기술주는 P/E가 10년 평균 이하인지, 은은 산업·투자 수요가 동시에 늘었는지 확인합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d11a7b38-b195-4474-8a0c-5906c6f2436c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B8%B0%EC%88%A0%EC%A3%BC%20%EA%B3%BC%EB%A7%A4%EB%8F%84%20%ED%8C%90%EB%8B%A8%20%EA%B8%B0%EC%A4%80\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>기술주 과매도 판단 기준은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-eeb9820a-a610-4ccf-94ed-bb632b8793b9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4ce1e7ab-b0e6-4be6-ad59-020a3e818621\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1018f722-f5ee-431e-9472-d7dd029cba32\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 분할 매수와 손절 라인을 설정합니다. 전체 포트폴리오 변동성을 5~8% 이하로 유지하면서 단계별로 매수를 진행합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c39cf6c0-a58b-496b-b38f-73b9790b2d68\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8%ED%8F%B4%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%20%EC%86%90%EC%A0%88%20%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%84%A4%EC%A0%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>손절 라인은 어떻게 잡나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-19df1361-4dc6-459e-b777-ef4f1756ce75\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a7e33fd2-ad54-4b9f-bd37-1be76627e510\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2a74e0e6-7207-4e32-a864-9d6db1cace3a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 헤징으로 리스크를 관리합니다. 금리 상승 우려 시 단기 국채나 인플레이션 연동 채권을 활용하고, 은 가격 급등 시 옵션을 이용합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d85588ef-1541-45bd-9476-c5389118c361\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%97%A4%EC%A7%95%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5%20%EC%9D%80%20%EC%98%B5%EC%85%98%20%ED%99%9C%EC%9A%A9\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>은 옵션 헤징은 어떻게?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bfb7a8b5-39aa-4b84-b3ef-d302bb1580f5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f56733e2-8c03-4a86-b040-00cc7d9eca04\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6098bbab-05af-42f0-a962-5ef5e6aa5fe1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-231f233f-2af1-487e-aa41-d6e7edfc9c91\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>현재 트렌드와 전망\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e9960b0d-a019-48ed-bed5-b352287abefb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5a6e2762-5696-4dbe-82d4-28542c06f793\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2705 기술주 부진이 지속되면서 가치주·배당주 비중이 늘어나고, 안전 자산 선호가 강화되어 금·은·디지털 골드 비중을 10~15% 유지하는 것이 바람직합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0c824643-296c-4cfe-a263-7266f33bbab7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=2024+%EC%95%88%EC%A0%84%20%EC%9E%90%EC%82%B0%20%EB%B9%84%EC%A4%91%20%EA%B6%8C%EC%9E%A5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>2024 안전 자산 비중은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-eb61fae1-8d50-4f2c-a20d-f715a32a6fac\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-10e1d2d6-64d6-487b-a266-c520d848ccac\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2705 은은 태양광·전기차 배터리 등 다양한 산업 수요가 급증하면서 “안전 + 실물” 이중 속성을 갖춘 매력적인 자산으로 부상하고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-43596cf0-983e-47f1-ac2c-edb28490b5db\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%9D%80%20%EC%82%B0%EC%97%85%20%EC%88%98%EC%9A%94%20%EC%A6%9D%EA%B0%80%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%9C%A0\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 은 수요가 늘고 있나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e647e889-97c5-4995-98ff-885db3994312\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-28f46576-82bc-4d92-ac5b-4323e21ebc9c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2705 지정학 리스크와 경제적 어려움이 계속되면 귀금속과 에너지 연계 포트폴리오가 방어적 역할을 할 가능성이 높습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-86fdd456-6c57-4b35-b541-969e7c4e5a06\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A7%80%EC%A0%95%ED%95%99%20%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%20%EA%B7%80%EA%B8%88%EC%86%8D%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>지정학 리스크와 귀금속 투자는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b6a08e71-0cbc-46e8-b7bf-23928098a2d5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a8d4b5ff-1a43-42a3-a43a-145a9410c040\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-56fc1a18-53cb-4047-ac6e-07771b34fe41\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f17f0ef7-d04d-4697-8fa3-c28f2a7e0c35\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>결론\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-91614be3-d6fc-489e-8122-78637e91d7f9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c467b732-fd36-4b44-b69c-e8915155d9b6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2740 비합리적인 시장은 결국 가격과 가치가 갈라지는 순간을 만들고, 우리는 그 순간을 포착해 “저가 매수”로 수익을 전환할 수 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6fa4012e-2122-493e-b78c-816f267a212f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B9%84%ED%95%A9%EB%A6%AC%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%9E%A5%20%EC%A0%80%EA%B0%80%20%EB%A7%A4%EC%88%98%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>비합리 시장에서 저가 매수는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-13f497c3-b725-4920-b440-2f42428b9351\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3a00b486-3f17-41aa-ab1e-dddf40754ca6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0d4ade8d-315f-4c99-90e9-4bfb00f9f45d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-90bd49bc-0907-41ee-8af3-02982a33349d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">주식 비합리 변동성 투자전략 감성\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3e4da0f9-ab61-433e-b1a8-0fb5c1a33a38\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-37e160a0-39e3-4622-9cb9-f4299bb1ce90\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\U0001f4ac\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4c7e185a-cbac-465e-b951-362b80c59c12\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu> K-POP / K-드라마 / 게임 트렌드 + 네이버 실시간 키워드 분석 + 자동화 커뮤니티\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-18d1da00-fe30-47df-954a-ae093daae6ce\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f15ac985-8fc9-4468-bb9c-ce24351a41bb\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\U0001f310\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9e77e27b-56db-46ae-8ddf-f010e2ea031a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu> 디스코드 채널 바로가기 \u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e8904103-b8fc-4618-9d33-6c843f7090f9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0a5f5387-aa38-45d9-a22f-45b053c5e74e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/article>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-canvas-bottom\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"se-canvas-bottom-button __edge-area\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-blind\">본문 추가\u003C/span>\u003C/button>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\">\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Cdiv class=\"__se-cursor-unrelated se-contents-toolbar-wrap se-is-on\" style=\"top: 220px; left: 597px;\">\u003Cul class=\"se-toolbar se-contents-toolbar se-contents-toolbar-text\">\u003Cli class=\"se-toolbar-item se-toolbar-item-font-family\" data-role=\"button-container\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-contents-toolbar-label-select-container __select-container\" data-type=\"label-select\" data-name=\"font-family\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" title=\"\" class=\"se-font-family-toolbar-button se-contents-toolbar-label-select-button __se-sentry\" data-group=\"contentsToolbar\" data-type=\"label-select\" data-name=\"font-family\" data-log=\"tetct.font\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"true\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-label\" data-role=\"label\" aria-hidden=\"true\">기본서체\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-toolbar-tooltip\">서체 변경\u