yle=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-433aa4a0-d7f6-4d5c-a106-7b282aa23336\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>새로운 규제 시점이 도래했습니다.\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7ae5866e-ef99-4991-bed5-b985dc0ec1ac\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 국내·글로벌 암호화폐 시장을 연결하려는 움직임이 급물살을 타고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d769fdfd-65b1-4973-828a-589219be5f38\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-42167736-7a47-4259-8a9e-270b0beb6a79\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A7%80%EA%B8%88%20%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%EA%B0%80%20%ED%99%94%EB%91%90%EA%B0%80%20%EB%90%90%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 지금 암호화폐 규제가 화두가 되었나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d86f55d8-8f98-4d5e-ae84-8410c979c31f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-263eec9f-12b6-4159-978e-5b5bdf8ef35a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3590ed11-c4c9-4fbb-b39c-23210d57abd0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cdba0072-5f89-4665-a3ec-5dcdbbd6690a\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-927c7e6a-9a2b-4a7f-8e4e-47bdc57f7a49\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 지금 왜 이슈가 되고 있나요?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-69e49757-42d6-45bc-ab73-01625ad9d66f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-113907df-1517-40da-bad5-b14167b69278\" cla