s=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 시장 흐름을 한눈에 보는 Mermaid 다이어그램\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1d2fed43-59c8-4926-b4b7-2d57df56940d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4b93090a-0bc5-489d-a4dd-6ad6f4519ea9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bc9988f6-177b-4643-8875-05056c53e86b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>KOSPI·KOSDAQ → S&amp;P 500 → NASDAQ → 원·달러 환율\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8b6c94b8-a290-4249-aae7-adeba7dae613\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 순으로 흐르는 흐름은 우리 시장이 글로벌 지수와 점점 동조화되고 있음을 보여줍니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8199163e-8c86-464f-8156-2805c70115f5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6b88fbb5-5689-4d04-8eb9-e9162d17331b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=KOSPI+S%26P500+%EC%97%B0%EA%B3%84%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A4%91%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>KOSPI와 S&amp;P 500 연계는 왜 중요한가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-85ee93a3-53ba-43d4-b478-6d7b1b84741a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-87d00119-4b72-4bc7-bf07-e7e38980645a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-72e86a76-6817-4a10-9e16-0b2aa413a57e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-68149137-e2c2-4c79-b555-4c3fe50eed0f\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fcf5399d-c742-4b29-86ff-a7b644e35c51\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 현 상황을 둘러싼 구조적 문제\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8f62468e-c321-43cd-9c95-0bcd4f33fba4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8524e8b-b391-4fcc-8f9b-7811c3ee07a6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ccd1d2c5-0817-4b28-beaf-90766178134d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>법·제도와 시장 속도의 격차\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8be29730-74b7-4392-bd4d-c8b082179269\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">가 가장 큰 걸림돌입니다. 스테이블 코인법이 아직 통과되지 않아 해외 코인 사용은 자유인데, 국내는 여전히 제한적입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dd63d7fe-5b43-4491-b069-791d80663369\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4019c45a-2279-4f3d-bf44-30717142cde0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A7%80%EC%97%B0%EB%90%98%EA%B3%A0%20%EC%9E%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>스테이블 코인 규제는 왜 지연되고 있나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-60987051-cb69-42c0-b7c4-e5ba68478318\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-59a0e5f2-ef54-47d9-aae7-4d34f4bb16b8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-52ba0002-4a5b-41e2-99fc-75090cdb5fc3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>51 % 룰 적용 논쟁\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0e7f8761-c365-43a3-af43-8aeea2fc54a7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">은 블록체인 보안과 투자자 보호 사이에서 팽팽히 맞서는 이슈이며, 명확한 가이드라인이 부재합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c1db38cf-e7f6-4010-9d24-953e9d742555\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cd007e0b-5003-4fad-af65-507fe0dcbe70\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=51%25+%EB%A3%B0%20%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9%20%EB%85%BC%EC%9F%81%20%ED%95%B5%EC%8B%AC%EC%9D%80%20%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%87%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>51 % 룰 적용 논쟁의 핵심은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8c34e500-9e9e-47fc-bbd6-a0bb9f1dccce\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0cda6b1c-577f-467e-9dac-c9b8cf81919a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e4453d3d-42d1-488e-b013-6e43c052d964\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌 표준 부재\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-87e8d9e4-e078-4ba2-b4ec-0b5934153c72\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">는 우리 기업이 해외 자본을 유치하는 데 큰 장벽이 되고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3c8f6998-d1a4-4f8a-927f-b9cddc5dda25\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4563cb8e-95e6-4b0b-bda8-01a1075b0ba2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B8%80%EB%A1%9C%EB%B2%8C%20%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%ED%91%9C%EC%A4%80%20%EB%B6%80%EC%9E%AC?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>글로벌 스테이블 코인 규제 표준 부재는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-73c27ec1-3ea0-4fdd-81bc-74feb534b226\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-489d7e8f-22ef-4f75-ae51-a04a30cdd134\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c4528c8f-5dc3-446e-bf60-f982b39c48ea\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8e9c3f4f-bf42-48e8-a0ec-1a7780821462\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a95a2339-b541-4f20-85b0-3907d72650a2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 향후 시나리오와 기대 트렌드\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c1b6f1f9-729c-4d94-a8ba-b97a7fdea447\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3d930476-76d2-4d72-b5e0-eebcc439b872\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 시나리오 A \u2013 신속 규제 도입 (6~12개월) : 스테이블 코인 발행·보고제와 51 % 룰 사전 검증 제도가 마련되면 해외 투자 유입이 급증하고, 국내 프로젝트가 빠르게 성장할 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e5c8a0ac-2227-4cac-9496-40f8f551d939\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e64c7858-afbd-4ef1-a649-46d9d760dc67\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%8B%A0%EC%86%8D%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EB%8F%84%EC%9E%85%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%A0%90?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>스테이블 코인 신속 규제 도입 시점은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e26c8a23-7c44-4472-8b89-0cd47968df02\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f7c5d335-feb9-42c2-bd91-1aaa541856bc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 시나리오 B \u2013 현상 유지 (1~2년) : 입법 논쟁이 장기화되면 규제 공백이 지속되고, 국내 거래소 의존도가 높아져 경쟁력이 약화됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8fd027b6-514a-4c0e-b85f-948065cc0671\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0a6243b0-6cb8-4c5b-8611-19dc5718291a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EA%B3%B5%EB%B0%B1%20%EC%A7%80%EC%86%8D%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%9A%B0%EB%A0%A4%EB%90%98%EB%8A%94%EA%B0%80?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>규제 공백 지속은 왜 우려되는가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-58cbbbf9-bf29-4f7d-bf8a-18ce2d066226\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3779f7be-352f-4001-9573-b25d9a16b8b6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f 시나리오 C \u2013 과도 규제 (6개월 내) : 51 % 룰을 강제 적용하고 거래소 전용 제한을 두면 혁신 생태계가 위축되고, 투자자는 해외로 눈을 돌릴 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d5e4947e-34fa-4f4b-8142-4dac317d6ada\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-815facad-9870-49ee-86b1-61991d115cf1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B3%BC%EB%8F%84%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EC%98%81%ED%96%A5?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>과도 규제가 암호화폐에 미치는 영향?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2d657a0f-72e1-4664-b497-d4f28ef3914d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ce47c5ca-9263-4f91-b767-e84067ffbfd6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9be81a8c-4d97-4456-9309-bcf6d75d5e20\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-589e651a-9eab-4dc9-a0a8-785ddc7cc1cd\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>5\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b8d16207-aa56-4844-b2b6-40953bf6f537\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 빠른 제도 정비를 위한 3가지 액션 플랜\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-65655cb4-2f33-42a3-93c1-196de442185e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-14a1cc8a-0bff-40f8-b8ff-4d3cdf5e2934\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b7a1ad8d-4ea1-4bb2-9c11-4898e77aa055\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>전문가 협의체 조기 설립\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-34759582-41cc-40a5-8331-6c0c5324a4b5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 금융당국·거래소·블록체인 스타트업이 한 테이블에 모여 3개월 내 가이드라인 초안을 도출합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-759117c9-506c-4dae-8c32-e1a8f637d189\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8b0ee536-0f23-4c04-a89c-62561a0e2855\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EC%A0%84%EB%AC%B8%EA%B0%80%20%ED%98%91%EC%9D%98%EC%B2%B4%20%EC%84%A4%EB%A6%BD%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>암호화폐 전문가 협의체 설립 방법은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-04ff5135-f60e-4c62-bda3-3a7b1234c7e1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a9b29ada-bd8c-4663-8237-cf1133f28738\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4c74d600-1720-489b-93d0-ff25063d5b8e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌 베스트 프랙티스 매핑\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4a029e1e-11d4-4d4a-bb56-9b39b9809cb3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 미국·EU·싱가포르 등 3개국의 규제 조항을 비교·분석해 한국 적용 가능성을 리포트합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-70f3aee8-898e-4f83-a47f-0fe19b311f08\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-411f16e6-afee-4dc4-901b-1ac12e1cd648\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B8%80%EB%A1%9C%EB%B2%8C%20%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EB%B2%A0%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%ED%94%84%EB%9E%99%ED%8B%B0%EC%8A%A4?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>글로벌 암호화폐 규제 베스트 프랙티스는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-05c0cc9d-742e-444c-8209-c00e407bb353\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e67b8740-4ab4-481f-9164-aa87a737933a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2740 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-87938781-b6ed-4fa6-bb4c-13be77cd594a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>투명·단계적 시행 로드맵 공개\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-95a73366-93a4-4dbc-af2c-78141ccaca9d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 2024\u20112025년 로드맵을 발표해 기업·투자자에게 예측 가능성을 제공합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2590feba-2428-4ecc-9285-9d8e03b893fe\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9310b6ed-e660-4738-ae72-cbbb41ac7e17\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C%EB%A7%B5%202024/2025?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>암호화폐 규제 로드맵 2024/2025는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1be06a9f-8122-453b-9cb7-f20c1c1ad291\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-100056b8-5aa0-4438-80af-4202e50b7f47\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-82d3df2f-1556-4954-b6a4-30967bf0c213\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8f9763df-c7a1-4053-baa3-973fbd0fed83\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>6\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9cd1b111-3c22-4144-a8d2-65b466407bb6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 마무리 \u2013 시차를 메우는 것이 곧 경쟁력\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ab08093c-4197-4bf1-b3e4-41f21da3a70e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-00b4e513-16aa-4bd3-9fb8-232b6bbece41\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2741 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-262f34a6-087d-4876-b95e-3091178fb75b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>시간은 금이 아니라 ‘규제 시간’\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3c45e4c5-be9b-487b-80a9-f384915bd62d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">이라는 점을 기억해야 합니다. 신속하고 국제 표준에 부합하는 규제 체계만이 국내 투자자를 보호하면서도 해외 자본·인재를 끌어들일 수 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1432b9f8-c08f-48fd-8ddd-396b4fb42a02\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-45b6cc08-56dc-47d1-8745-24e2ec1a0306\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%8B%9C%EA%B0%84%20%EC%99%9C%20%ED%95%B5%EC%8B%AC%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>규제 시간이 왜 핵심인가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0da5940c-543d-41f5-a544-fd7e04d621c6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c6e853f4-d0ae-4753-8f68-65f19e158e31\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-814158e7-4ce2-4e50-83f2-03c0fb2e77b6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>지금 행동하지 않으면 세계와의 격차는 더욱 확대됩니다.\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-eaee662b-02a0-4de8-8700-45cf57adb55d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 빠른 제도 정비가 바로 미래 경쟁력을 좌우합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bd5f265d-7fa3-47c8-9b88-d94265102aa1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7d6fda3e-af9e-4ac0-9665-d6f48fd55258\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%8B%9C%EB%8C%80%20%EB%8C%80%EC%9D%91%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>암호화폐 규제 시대 대응 전략은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-351569aa-e09c-439d-b340-accdd9c3b034\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-84c551af-2d45-48fe-81dd-1b6afa46cd79\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4a8373f4-f19c-47af-b90e-66cec0027493\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-68fa1966-9176-4aab-bba5-dbd2ca80e0e0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">스테이블코인법 51%룰 암호화폐규제 글로벌시장 KOSPI Bitcoin Ethereum 금융혁신 규제시대\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-aa3a8192-c38c-4c57-826e-ce1a6748c2f3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e8fc20c0-e35b-42ee-8843-57699f717f68\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\U0001f4ac\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7f0d1aa1-9731-4556-b0ae-c4008fac285a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu> K-POP / K-드라마 / 게임 트렌드 + 네이버 실시간 키워드 분석 + 자동화 커뮤니티\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d337a536-8b41-4147-b02c-241ffb4185ce\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c9909a61-4788-48a6-92fb-58c6466e5ef3\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\U0001f310\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-09115651-d9ef-4dce-acdc-7aa47b3731c1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://discord.gg/TDNw2hSD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu> 디스코드 채널 바로가기 \u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7d329aac-8408-4e67-bb7c-1db34e9ae870\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-041f2305-fcea-47b7-93ac-aacaef62da01\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/article>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-canvas-bottom\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"se-canvas-bottom-button __edge-area\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-blind\">본문 추가\u003C/span>\u003C/button>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\">\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/section>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-insert-menu\" data-update-flag=\"26047.689102463446\" style=\"top: 1592.28px;\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-insert-point-marker-button\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-insert-point-marker-icon\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-blind\">추가할 컴포넌트를 선택하세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cul class=\"se-insert-menu-panel\">\u003Cli class=\"se-insert-menu-item se-insert-menu-item-image\">\u003Cbutton type=\"button\" class=\"se-insert-menu-button se-insert-m