 rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 지금 암호화폐 규제가 화두가 되었나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d86f55d8-8f98-4d5e-ae84-8410c979c31f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-263eec9f-12b6-4159-978e-5b5bdf8ef35a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3590ed11-c4c9-4fbb-b39c-23210d57abd0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cdba0072-5f89-4665-a3ec-5dcdbbd6690a\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-927c7e6a-9a2b-4a7f-8e4e-47bdc57f7a49\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 지금 왜 이슈가 되고 있나요?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-69e49757-42d6-45bc-ab73-01625ad9d66f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-113907df-1517-40da-bad5-b14167b69278\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cf833aa6-b862-4887-9919-9c533683b5f7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>스테이블 코인법\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-54adbd09-4a98-4abd-8b95-562651533879\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">과 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-88f4e2bd-c152-4cc4-9bbd-6e373e1971c3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>51 % 룰\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5778771e-c184-485a-bd04-db075aae056e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 적용 논쟁이 법제화 단계에서 정체되면서, 해외 서비스와 국내 사용자의 격차가 눈에 띄게 벌어지고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ee48d9c6-3bfd-4824-be86-e5ed83f8873c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9f0590d6-23c4-4cd5-8fb6-d08aa1b26759\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%EB%B2%95%20%ED%98%84%EC%9E%AC%20%EC%A7%84%ED%96%89%EC%83%81%ED%99%A9?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>스테이블 코인법 현재 진행 상황은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9bf92c75-4705-468c-9e6b-92b3c688b024\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fcc943cf-451c-4c96-9200-61b1f0c10c50\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9e004ec9-cbda-471c-8758-4b65dc404912\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2afe3cea-f5d0-4e15-8043-f8c6b279981f\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e92073a3-9ff8-42d4-84a0-931edd9206a3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 시장 흐름을 한눈에 보는 Mermaid 다이어그램\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1d2fed43-59c8-4926-b4b7-2d57df56940d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4b93090a-0bc5-489d-a4dd-6ad6f4519ea9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bc9988f6-177b-4643-8875-05056c53e86b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>KOSPI·KOSDAQ → S&amp;P 500 → NASDAQ → 원·달러 환율\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8b6c94b8-a290-4249-aae7-adeba7dae613\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 순으로 흐르는 흐름은 우리 시장이 글로벌 지수와 점점 동조화되고 있음을 보여줍니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8199163e-8c86-464f-8156-2805c70115f5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6b88fbb5-5689-4d04-8eb9-e9162d17331b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=KOSPI+S%26P500+%EC%97%B0%EA%B3%84%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A4%91%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>KOSPI와 S&amp;P 500 연계는 왜 중요한가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-85ee93a3-53ba-43d4-b478-6d7b1b84741a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-87d00119-4b72-4bc7-bf07-e7e38980645a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-72e86a76-6817-4a10-9e16-0b2aa413a57e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-68149137-e2c2-4c79-b555-4c3fe50eed0f\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fcf5399d-c742-4b29-86ff-a7b644e35c51\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 현 상황을 둘러싼 구조적 문제\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8f62468e-c321-43cd-9c95-0bcd4f33fba4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8524e8b-b391-4fcc-8f9b-7811c3ee07a6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ccd1d2c5-0817-4b28-beaf-90766178134d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>법·제도와 시장 속도의 격차\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8be29730-74b7-4392-bd4d-c8b082179269\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">가 가장 큰 걸림돌입니다. 스테이블 코인법이 아직 통과되지 않아 해외 코인 사용은 자유인데, 국내는 여전히 제한적입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dd63d7fe-5b43-4491-b069-791d80663369\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4019c45a-2279-4f3d-bf44-30717142cde0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A7%80%EC%97%B0%EB%90%98%EA%B3%A0%20%EC%9E%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>스테이블 코인 규제는 왜 지연되고 있나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-60987051-cb69-42c0-b7c4-e5ba68478318\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-59a0e5f2-ef54-47d9-aae7-4d34f4bb16b8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-52ba0002-4a5b-41e2-99fc-75090cdb5fc3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>51 % 룰 적용 논쟁\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0e7f8761-c365-43a3-af43-8aeea2fc54a7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">은 블록체인 보안과 투자자 보호 사이에서 팽팽히 맞서는 이슈이며, 명확한 가이드라인이 부재합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c1db38cf-e7f6-4010-9d24-953e9d742555\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cd007e0b-5003-4fad-af65-507fe0dcbe70\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=51%25+%EB%A3%B0%20%EC%A0%81%EC%9A%A9%20%EB%85%BC%EC%9F%81%20%ED%95%B5%EC%8B%AC%EC%9D%80%20%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%87%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>51 % 룰 적용 논쟁의 핵심은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8c34e500-9e9e-47fc-bbd6-a0bb9f1dccce\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0cda6b1c-577f-467e-9dac-c9b8cf81919a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e4453d3d-42d1-488e-b013-6e43c052d964\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌 표준 부재\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-87e8d9e4-e078-4ba2-b4ec-0b5934153c72\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">는 우리 기업이 해외 자본을 유치하는 데 큰 장벽이 되고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3c8f6998-d1a4-4f8a-927f-b9cddc5dda25\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4563cb8e-95e6-4b0b-bda8-01a1075b0ba2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B8%80%EB%A1%9C%EB%B2%8C%20%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%ED%91%9C%EC%A4%80%20%EB%B6%80%EC%9E%AC?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>글로벌 스테이블 코인 규제 표준 부재는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-73c27ec1-3ea0-4fdd-81bc-74feb534b226\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-489d7e8f-22ef-4f75-ae51-a04a30cdd134\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c4528c8f-5dc3-446e-bf60-f982b39c48ea\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8e9c3f4f-bf42-48e8-a0ec-1a7780821462\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a95a2339-b541-4f20-85b0-3907d72650a2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 향후 시나리오와 기대 트렌드\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c1b6f1f9-729c-4d94-a8ba-b97a7fdea447\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3d930476-76d2-4d72-b5e0-eebcc439b872\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 시나리오 A \u2013 신속 규제 도입 (6~12개월) : 스테이블 코인 발행·보고제와 51 % 룰 사전 검증 제도가 마련되면 해외 투자 유입이 급증하고, 국내 프로젝트가 빠르게 성장할 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e5c8a0ac-2227-4cac-9496-40f8f551d939\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e64c7858-afbd-4ef1-a649-46d9d760dc67\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%8A%A4%ED%85%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%94%20%EC%BD%94%EC%9D%B8%20%EC%8B%A0%EC%86%8D%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EB%8F%84%EC%9E%85%20%EC%8B%9C%EC%A0%90?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>스테이블 코인 신속 규제 도입 시점은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e26c8a23-7c44-4472-8b89-0cd47968df02\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f7c5d335-feb9-42c2-bd91-1aaa541856bc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 시나리오 B \u2013 현상 유지 (1~2년) : 입법 논쟁이 장기화되면 규제 공백이 지속되고, 국내 거래소 의존도가 높아져 경쟁력이 약화됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8fd027b6-514a-4c0e-b85f-948065cc0671\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0a6243b0-6cb8-4c5b-8611-19dc5718291a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EA%B3%B5%EB%B0%B1%20%EC%A7%80%EC%86%8D%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%9A%B0%EB%A0%A4%EB%90%98%EB%8A%94%EA%B0%80?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>규제 공백 지속은 왜 우려되는가?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-58cbbbf9-bf29-4f7d-bf8a-18ce2d066226\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3779f7be-352f-4001-9573-b25d9a16b8b6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f 시나리오 C \u2013 과도 규제 (6개월 내) : 51 % 룰을 강제 적용하고 거래소 전용 제한을 두면 혁신 생태계가 위축되고, 투자자는 해외로 눈을 돌릴 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d5e4947e-34fa-4f4b-8142-4dac317d6ada\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-815facad-9870-49ee-86b1-61991d115cf1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EA%B3%BC%EB%8F%84%20%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%9C%20%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EC%98%81%ED%96%A5?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>과도 규제가 암호화폐에 미치는 영향?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2d657a0f-72e1-4664-b497-d4f28ef3914d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ce47c5ca-9263-4f91-b767-e84067ffbfd6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9be81a8c-4d97-4456-9309-bcf6d75d5e20\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-589e651a-9eab-4dc9-a0a8-785ddc7cc1cd\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>5\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b8d16207-aa56-4844-b2b6-40953bf6f537\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 빠른 제도 정비를 위한 3가지 액션 플랜\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-65655cb4-2f33-42a3-93c1-196de442185e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-14a1cc8a-0bff-40f8-b8ff-4d3cdf5e2934\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b7a1ad8d-4ea1-4bb2-9c11-4898e77aa055\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>전문가 협의체 조기 설립\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-34759582-41cc-40a5-8331-6c0c5324a4b5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 금융당국·거래소·블록체인 스타트업이 한 테이블에 모여 3개월 내 가이드라인 초안을 도출합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-759117c9-506c-4dae-8c32-e1a8f637d189\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8b0ee536-0f23-4c04-a89c-62561a0e2855\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%95%94%ED%98%B8%ED%99%94%ED%8F%90%20%EC%A0%84%EB%AC%B8%EA%B0%80%20%ED%98%91%EC%9D%98%EC%B2%B4%20%EC%84%A4%EB%A6%BD%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95?\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>암호화폐 전문가 협의체 설립 방법은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-04ff5135-f60e-4c62-bda3-3a7b1234c7e1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a9b29ada-bd8c-4663-8237-cf1133f28738\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4c74d600-1720-489b-93d0-ff25063d5b8e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌 베스트 프랙티스 매핑\u003C/b