 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>암호화폐 규제 로드맵 2024/2025는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1be06a9f-8122-453b-9cb7-f20c1c1ad291\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-100056b8-5aa0-4438-80af-4202e50b7f47\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-82d3df2f-1556-4954-b6a4-30967bf0c213\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8f9763df-c7a1-4053-baa3-973fbd0fed83\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>6\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9cd1b111-3c22-4144-a8d2-65b466407bb6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 마무리 \u2013 시차를 메우는 것이 곧 경쟁력\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ab08093c-4197-4bf1-b3e4-41f21da3a70e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-00b4e513-16aa-4bd3-9fb8-232b6bbece41\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2741 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-262f34a6-087d-4876-b95e-3091178fb75b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>시간은 금이 아니라 ‘규제 시간’\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3c45e4c5-be9b-487b-80a9-f384915bd62d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">이라는 점을 기억해야 합니다. 신속하고 국제 표준에 부합하는 규제 체계만이 국내 투자자를 보호하면서도 해외 자본·인재를 끌어들일 수 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1432b9f8-c08f-48fd-8ddd-396b4fb42a02\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-45b6cc08-56dc-47d1-8745-24e2ec1a0306\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-hre