\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-36e1e23f-f960-48fc-a596-6ab613c34063\" data-compid=\"SE-36e1e23f-f960-48fc-a596-6ab613c34063\" data-a11y-title=\"본문\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-36e1e23f-f960-48fc-a596-6ab613c34063\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-450292f8-a7a5-4aa4-8765-b80059a9259b\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-9ba8f7ce-987d-493e-9a45-70284739b0f2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-56f011ec-b467-4ac7-b2e2-58b0bcfe6bbe\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1f1a779b-78c3-4ad4-8165-ffdebb8840d7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bbf063e9-6404-465e-bdca-32ecd8f697bc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://%EC%B0%B8%EC%86%8C%EC%8B%9D.com\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>더 많은 소식이 궁금하다면 참소식 포켓 뉴스에서 확인해보시겠어요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ff9a9e99-a9d4-45fd-a1e2-b643da12d11e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-89b17c7c-f143-4cab-af66-0e10647c5cf9\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a146fdcf-d598-4bd0-8f55-befb061588ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-219f71ce-64dd-4f4f-9f7f-dff59a5fec32\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-36465e16-8b95-4012-b6ea-9b946bcfcd36\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0cd17ef8-9d46-44ab-9bac-e3685aa806e7\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-fa6ea2cd-cfac-4161-9aa8-4b3fa1930374\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-119f843b-a19b-43fb-9560-3ae027c94599\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>해외 파이어(FIRE)족이 전한 ‘현대차 우선주·배당’ 성공 스토리\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d1f1e000-e970-42c7-88be-1705ef7392dd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-52dc097f-caa5-4244-8ca1-0626be577a53\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2024년 현재, 해외에서 FIRE 생활을 실천하며 현대차 우선주 배당만으로 9억 원 이상 자산을 모으신 개인 투자자분이 계십니다. 그 비결이 궁금하시지 않으신가요? \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1ee829bb-b40b-4484-8eab-506f5d491dee\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%98%84%EB%8C%80%EC%B0%A8%20%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%A3%BC%20%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>현대차 우선주 배당 전략은 어떨까요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-79fe6bc3-71ca-4389-a796-61c7b7c4af37\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9ea90f6d-67a1-4f6b-a9a1-f4ef0fdefa5e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d89726a7-d557-4fe7-8c75-c893a59ec1f9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ee4f8397-1920-42dc-949a-a1de8dc5debd\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-171f6904-b2bf-405b-9c78-d4c2140bb780\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a2d1230a-bdb8-46f4-9f76-2fe7857c189c\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2db80829-2c54-4a30-a632-0acffe60b30d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b62a4dc2-9a2e-4b85-99c7-1ce492c4a4b5\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c7da525c-f580-4797-ba2a-0cfd327caa9a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-885e77e0-7cdc-4e32-8670-cee1243e7dcf\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6552c61e-8e78-4bcd-9640-a83c6401e642\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9e78cf59-0b6f-4eff-a73e-a9e6ce633271\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9e10057d-5560-4737-813e-e1cd2681a8d4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 핵심 요약\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ce6a7552-cf9d-446c-ba05-ee13e8e7174d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d1667851-d6ca-4595-88e6-746636b2843f\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2714\ufe0f\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b67172d7-ce76-437c-8d7f-2c456e716bbb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 주인공은 해외 거주 30대 한국인 투자자이며, 주요 전략은 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7a4cbeda-f821-40ac-af59-283186e16b84\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>현대차 우선주(보통주가 아닌 우선주) 배당\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-886bd0c7-3b32-4e8c-93a8-bbc0c160b6f4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">을 중심으로 포트폴리오를 구성한 점입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-88245dff-14e8-44ba-a460-468551273161\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d59806e9-91a5-47b2-9912-cad773d2dc5f\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2714\ufe0f\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6222b5ea-ac2b-4604-85f6-a5c5f0015c48\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 높은 배당률과 우선주 특성, 그리고 원·달러 환율 상승 효과를 동시에 활용해 자산을 급성장시켰습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-216df6a9-c106-4599-9301-e647a2fb7c4b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-46cd242c-4f7c-4a6a-99e5-f0ce208c0fcc\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2714\ufe0f\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4d6896bc-781b-4cdb-9926-54914ad50c67\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 이 모델은 국내외 투자 커뮤니티에서 ‘우선주·배당 FIRE’라는 새로운 투자 패러다임으로 주목받고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d614005f-97d1-4e69-9b2c-b04188e15209\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6d264afe-77dc-41f3-8e52-2b0f9c1f1092\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%A3%BC%20%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20FIRE%20%EC%84%B1%EA%B3%B5%20%EC%82%AC%EB%A1%80\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>우선주 배당 FIRE 성공 사례는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8d4d1500-7517-468c-aeaa-74028b72923d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d12de342-7c83-45f4-8d43-052eb3742a71\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dbe48195-7797-48e0-aa39-d05256beabc7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1934d4a8-a669-4d90-b3a0-1e9c301bdf72\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-63e7fe86-1826-47f9-a16b-ac1a3a8e8e29\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ce4ac9bf-42d3-48fb-9d20-5204b6105d2c\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-254c94f7-4aa7-46a7-bd63-52479016508e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cd40eaf8-eca0-4e16-a76a-658ddf4ef075\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-023ca2de-9067-4dc0-a3f0-cf57275b8b5f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-75f0aa9a-251a-4db3-a78a-488742c5587c\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b7581671-306b-4ca4-bcd3-5ea84953c45e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-277435c1-369f-457a-972f-d21056066cc8\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-99699971-78ac-4f5d-b014-b8bc193a2648\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 왜 현대차 우선주인가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-edb5521d-9822-4605-8a5c-b283face8512\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-45ad9346-6229-443c-960e-c7b4097bcd4b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 우선주는 보통주 대비 평균 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9a1021ca-15e3-4967-a613-19799cfe42d4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>+1~2%p\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f47edb94-d1a5-4692-8ae6-e492fa127f0c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 높은 배당수익률을 제공하며, 연 4~5% 수준의 안정적인 현금 흐름을 보장합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d3367f10-a2d8-4b50-88eb-61eef58332bb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cb8ed9a2-547f-418d-9a30-71ac5488567c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 현대차는 전동화·수소·글로벌 시장 확대 전략으로 재무구조가 탄탄해 배당 지속 가능성이 높습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-fb444260-afae-4c9b-bbe9-c9a0797c55b5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9b6741bb-ffcf-446f-9e46-4ea8bb90384c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 해외 거주자는 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dea20774-e0c6-4d08-825b-5a917a6afbe2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>USD/KRW 환율 상승\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ac04b18f-323d-4b00-ad5e-26db48660c80\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 시 배당금이 원화 기준으로 더욱 커지는 ‘환율 보너스’를 받게 됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-59f710b2-a806-4e61-ac23-e5920e73146e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-815d4c45-c155-4e16-bd33-85ebdcc0209f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%98%84%EB%8C%80%EC%B0%A8%20%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%A3%BC%20%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%EC%88%98%EC%9D%B5%20%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>현대차 우선주 배당과 환율 효과는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8113d215-a1f6-4692-b979-a2abbf2c0c53\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a9051d46-2264-4036-ac95-1b1313b6564b\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f48951d8-6a6d-4f7b-a0f3-94e812b52126\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-246f37c0-b81a-4e86-af2a-e6c7dba93d03\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d736fec3-7a61-4253-9e48-3a9a661811a9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-eba4f3ea-a291-465d-b134-33b5837c99ba\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-91b64172-16ab-414c-9930-08057c240ca0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8600be71-df01-465f-8cc3-a4e5625ec42d\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e02f3519-4802-499c-9d86-1aa8b03954f8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7e72b0d5-f2cf-41bd-907a-fc4638cbc221\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-817ac049-41ba-4ea3-ba0a-60ba15a36bf6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4a15a0b0-4d3b-45c7-96fa-0cddbb06de29\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a73c8e32-c6ee-440f-b9b3-c63ed1182064\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 투자 포트폴리오 구성\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b70c872a-db87-4e28-a1a8-57b61cd0523f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e6f1e2b9-9ad0-4cf3-9293-0aaedc1f2272\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 목표 자산 9억 원을 달성하기 위해 전체 포트폴리오의 30~40%를 현대차 우선주에 투자했습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9c446764-39fb-49dc-ac6d-80cb0e10349c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-210cf9f1-61dc-4d76-916b-305ebfbcb92c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 나머지는 글로벌 배당주, 채권, 금·은(달러·유로) 예금 등으로 다변화해 리스크를 완화했습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1216e103-126a-4499-a3ad-dcba8362b3db\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0d3c1ee1-d837-4776-8d07-77046f0b02be\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 리스크 관리 차원에서 지정학 리스크(중동·러시아·중국)와 금리·인플레이션 변동을 정기적으로 점검합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f22784d7-8020-4e40-ae51-fe6bb5d0edd9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b35ee5c3-02a0-4995-b1e4-8643931e439b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8%ED%8F%B4%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%20%EB%8B%A4%EB%B3%80%ED%99%94%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>배당 포트폴리오 다변화는 어떻게?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2c521023-b55f-42b3-bff1-dda725815181\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a99d65ad-1142-45a7-8c7a-f89fcf991711\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-41ab57c1-778b-4f96-8781-34d3dfc7e0e5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1b33eb80-5b57-48d3-99ad-7e5a9fabdec9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-66932be9-a63e-41cb-8e13-4078255ba70f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ff3acbd1-7862-4896-b864-cc981e19c148\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-058d5dba-0bb8-4ebf-a5db-b20748281281\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-615c6b80-8fa1-4db8-b839-cd78a6d5f1be\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-72796a3a-3c7e-462a-8ffd-f03336897285\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0232b82f-6dfc-46cc-9397-cafe57342261\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-eb71ed53-419b-4c7b-a24e-7f86fa621e63\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-928f4a1c-3244-41f7-8cf4-db00de676406\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3a9d54d9-f222-444e-9f7b-71e3f6ea28ae\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 현지에서 활용하는 환율 전략\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cb9fe3ba-0bcd-42a3-b1e2-79de8975c8cd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d378bbff-b8b4-4909-a547-c4ab9ab6e90e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c 해외 거주자는 달러·유로 기반 예금·채권을 보유해 환율 상승 시 ‘환율 헤지’ 효과를 얻습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-40e43ac7-3b53-4ce4-9cea-f76132ea88c9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-11135242-0775-40cd-8630-a1c8b946c7c5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c 원화 약세가 지속될 경우 배당금이 원화 기준으로 크게 늘어나 자산 성장 엔진이 됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-bf58ef8e-8d14-4804-ae90-45a589bc8df7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1448934a-2d5e-4cc8-b42b-2d27c2dc69be\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c 급격한 원화 강세 시에는 포지션을 리밸런싱해 위험을 최소화합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e35ad636-dff4-42b5-934b-b59b6b4a92e4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-319ee3b9-c4dc-42b1-9165-119a1a4aed3d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%99%98%EC%9C%A8%20%ED%97%A4%EC%A7%80%20%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>환율 헤지와 배당 전략은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f8e7a69a-8ae2-45e3-afda-54c20e975d8f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cabce97c-8d38-47b4-9a4f-7236e26e891a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4fbc33e5-c112-4e27-aa64-8cb5cc655eb6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-12b59dad-1294-412b-99d6-b3551a939910\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f0370007-26e3-4d2b-b1c4-1258332d8b54\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-04c82e78-2e78-47db-b807-6ea03e875f50\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a246a0ba-649d-4459-b148-b000530199da\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-918e0d8c-19b6-4781-b9af-d39987b9e28e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-203aa721-8833-4114-85d0-7b9e6593c03d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8dfe7867-9b09-43fc-8dd5-ff4f46f3bbbe\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7b1df94b-738b-4f54-b15c-e6789b264d33\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b94bb16b-2f55-4dab-be0a-dcb6828041de\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>5\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-351663d1-6081-45ee-86c5-1203c434f5f4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 파생 효과와 앞으로의 흐름\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-65ca40cb-6f24-43cc-b085-eb907c344ce3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5597667f-a4fe-4d88-a846-8972749e6d50\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 우선주·배당 FIRE 모델이 카카오스토리·네이버 카페 등에 퍼지며 초보 투자자들의 관심을 끌고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7f2473fb-74ce-43af-a8b9-e622498915f6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d1db9288-bed2-499f-949e-fb8f1a28a6b0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 현대차 외에도 LG화학·SK하이닉스 등 우선주 발행 기업들의 매력이 재조명되고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c417bb12-d542-4e40-8a2f-b2a40cd0dbc7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-31b74f5f-1c14-4ab6-add0-5c800a9998a8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 고소득 해외 거주자의 배당 과세와 이중과세 방지 협정 논의가 활발해질 전망입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a6f2a104-b71c-4452-a2bc-a722e305d130\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3016a3f7-9303-4b15-a688-ef9df6ede949\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%9A%B0%EC%84%A0%EC%A3%BC%20%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%EC%84%B8%EC%A0%9C%20%EB%85%BC%EC%9D%98\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>우선주 배당 세제 논의는?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a70d7fdf-5141-46b5-9829-135090748c4c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-795bb0cc-1db9-4c9d-aa4b-288776686e28\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e0208a85-051b-4d68-8fa8-34330a629838\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8ef4aff-c709-461e-9afc-bd493395f202\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-eab50017-6447-4b6d-9631-82535626f991\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5e11853b-cd9d-4db9-96f8-9210128325b5\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e53c2a98-43fa-4b3b-ad62-89cfe75bafd3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f1aa3f9e-63f8-4de0-b383-0e4e69d33a92\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7a1d010d-c831-4ad4-9f91-c725bcca36e2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e58787ef-f24f-42c2-9b5d-a54691367d29\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6085862d-99ad-4fe3-8882-b8e81c5cb8fd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9bdfd01a-e882-4152-9a0b-e6205e606b29\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>6\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1be9874a-1963-4bda-999d-fccb26893128\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 실전 팁\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2b9e2c63-d1f0-43d7-99e7-836b2169d86f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-15a3f609-f9c7-450c-988b-b2cc77a6790d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c56f244c-5b32-48b6-b565-e4527286f82e\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-71a6af56-acbb-4897-b555-071bbf8249ad\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 한국 증시 우선주 리스트와 배당률을 확인하고, 현대차 외에도 고배당 우선주를 탐색하세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8cd7d2d4-52c7-41d2-9294-fabec2d90d82\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3c0d0a83-0f66-42d7-b047-271afd74dfde\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5d8cbe86-594f-4d41-8617-5cd4d8505666\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-baa5e502-0e35-45af-a955-b304f51a01a6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 해외 은행·증권을 통해 달러·유로 기반 예금·채권 계좌를 개설해 환율 헤지를 준비하세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0561384c-03ec-4d59-b48b-e1fe73563ddc\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-05e93e86-751d-41b1-a807-b053f9a7d2bb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2f95e39c-1cc8-49ff-89a2-69e4663ca331\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fa86ab49-6290-4c37-9e35-04ed5f4b40f3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 포트폴리오 10~15%를 금·채권·스테이킹 기반 디지털 자산에 배분해 변동성에 대비하세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3ba80ee3-728f-4efe-bfcc-fca3bd5802d8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a62aa511-f0e6-4762-bf66-eeecb7c32161\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7074948c-d370-4224-9d62-bdfeaea49362\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f5301f41-2c11-4ed2-9d65-d054491f3a87\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 매월/분기마다 포트폴리오를 리뷰하고, 지정학·환율 변동에 맞춰 배당 비중을 조정하세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4f23c766-e95d-4729-bf67-f830addbaebd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d4c04cbe-d77c-45f4-986a-7fbefc51ec35\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B0%B0%EB%8B%B9%20%ED%8F%AC%ED%8A%B8%ED%8F%B4%EB%A6%AC%EC%98%A4%20%EB%A6%AC%EB%B7%B0%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>배당 포트폴리오 리뷰는 어떻게?\u003C/u>\u003C/span