진 위치 이동\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">위치이동\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-del-image\" title=\"제목 배경 사진 삭제\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button-label\">제목 배경 사진 삭제\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-cover-moving-button-container\">\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-discard-position\" title=\"위치 이동 취소\">취소\u003C/span>\u003Cspan class=\"se-cover-button se-cover-button-confirm-position\" title=\"위치 이동 저장\">확인\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-bf98b074-6152-48e3-ac3f-04ed786636a9\" data-compid=\"SE-bf98b074-6152-48e3-ac3f-04ed786636a9\" data-a11y-title=\"본문\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-component-content\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-drop-indicator\" data-unitid=\"\" data-compid=\"SE-bf98b074-6152-48e3-ac3f-04ed786636a9\" data-direction=\"top\">\u003Cdiv class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default se-is-focused\">\u003Cdiv id=\"SE-30c6b87f-c377-4f15-b191-6b0d0d9002f8\" class=\"se-module se-module-text __se-unit\">\u003Cp id=\"SE-ad26bc3f-a4ae-414d-b4c0-6bfa12b5ba00\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b5a81ad7-f7ea-48f1-b144-9002fd2177ee\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5364b8c5-15ec-46b4-93fd-01c8e0cbdc3a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ab6fc0be-338b-44d4-9387-0de5fd23013b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://%EC%B0%B8%EC%86%8C%EC%8B%9D.com\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>더 많은 소식이 궁금하다면 참소식 포켓 뉴스에서 확인해보시겠어요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5826feec-a418-40dc-aa02-793e73db4e43\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-09d4b7be-e0ef-45a1-af83-b51562fbdf06\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5bd56fc5-40f6-4fc8-83bf-509ab76abb23\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3ffcbd1a-5cf8-46f4-865b-094d40187c84\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>오늘의 주요 포인트\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8f064f35-5f96-4889-b0e0-7c78acdee4a6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9b50e540-87d1-446f-812b-f5617b2a4c2d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 최근 발표된 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-39971dff-d779-48f7-b75f-50f79c1e7e38\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=Oracle+%EC%8B%A4%EC%A0%81+%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C+%EB%8B%A4%EB%88%88%EC%96%B4%EB%96%84%EA%B3%BC\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>Oracle 실적 발표는 어떤 의미인가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6bbbee07-5164-442b-a287-56b87f6d0555\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">에 따르면 매출·영업이익이 전년 대비 12~15% 성장했고, 클라우드 서비스 매출 비중이 30%를 넘어섰습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-101326b8-eb0a-436b-9669-29ff4df9bc90\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-66c754cf-05a2-424f-8866-a5a7a2576999\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 RPO가 전분기 대비 22% 상승해, 향후 매출 계약량이 크게 늘어날 것으로 기대됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d6753f8a-8d32-49d7-b49a-7a28cd8ad951\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2e18cdf5-8582-4481-9b5e-4fd978e50f01\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 발표 직후 주가가 +4.3% 급등했으며, 주요 기술주 지수(NASDAQ·KOSDAQ 등)도 동조 상승했습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-db3a4d8e-705d-4cd0-bde8-66c05a17578e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-20088525-636f-45d1-ac95-63e359cd9c97\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5076696f-cb27-4a48-926c-434102731fb8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f539f665-427e-464a-aed5-a866bf3e2150\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌·국내 시장 흐름 \u2013 왜 오라클이 주목받는가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e8e86127-59f3-4d1c-91b1-15ee4383471c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-be487a54-dd1f-4040-a83f-12cdd0bfd559\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 전 세계 IT 투자 회복과 클라우드·AI 수요 확대가 오라클의 성장 동력을 강화하고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-6e1f4320-f9c9-4642-b1f0-ebf93f6c0919\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d114a0b0-676b-406d-bbcb-bb5a655e2e88\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2740 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9edd4634-02fb-44c3-9328-0611e3ba007a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%96%B4%EB%94%94%EB%90%98%EC+%EC%84%B9%EC%97%AC+%EC%96%B4%EB%94%94+%EC%9E%84%EC%84%9C%20AI%20%EB%8F%99%EA%B2%BD\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>AI와 클라우드가 시장에 어떤 영향을 미치나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-242cb3b1-90b9-413a-9ca7-37d600fb5c94\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">에 대한 질문을 통해, 오라클의 OCI·SaaS 확대가 전체 IT 시장 성장에 큰 시그널이 됨을 확인할 수 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-dc26040d-1173-4467-aa23-06b931333919\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a3e1b62f-e792-405c-889e-019c4c4085e4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 아래 Mermaid 다이어그램은 주요 지수와 오라클 주가의 연관성을 시각화합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-029b6596-95b3-4fee-952b-7f53cd4b0d85\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fea284c6-4f00-4ed8-bc8f-791a78fca6cf\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">```mermaid flowchart TD A[KOSPI] --&gt; B[국내 주식 흐름] C[KOSDAQ] --&gt; D[기술·벤처 성장] E[NASDAQ] --&gt; F[미국 기술주 상승] G[Oracle] --&gt; H[클라우드·AI 매출 확대] ```\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-90d3d423-0cb9-44d4-8c0a-4b3eceb354c5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-54ed8258-8e61-4193-8c2b-7509581e7421\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c5fa89db-1b63-4747-9181-7063f060595f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6e70f365-7787-47b3-88b7-468f1dc4f33b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>왜 RPO가 중요한가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a92ebb4f-733e-466e-9d4d-7fc3b01a54bc\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4e5ed505-70d3-45ea-8d4f-908aa8683cfb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b RPO(Revenue Performance Obligation)는 계약 기반 매출이 실제 인식될 때까지의 ‘예상 매출’이며, 기업의 미래 현금 흐름을 가늠하게 해 줍니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3f5deeaa-f8fd-4659-8096-4a1cbeb39fdb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-aace2c5d-3771-4bf9-927b-6fb8bf0799ef\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2741 전분기 대비 RPO가 22% 상승한 것은 수주량이 늘어나고 고객과의 장기 계약이 강화됐음을 의미합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-703fca1d-4ef2-4b26-b26b-8597a0ed01a2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-72d4b940-a086-4225-94e3-c3e3cc3f7e12\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272c 오라클 사례처럼 RPO 개선은 투자자 심리에 긍정적인 ‘전망 전환’ 신호가 되고, 주가 급등을 촉발합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4a6481dd-6a01-4a08-b4bd-4713731b3251\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f4ba1e69-2913-463e-81ad-22fc794ef9cd\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1410d026-e270-403a-ac41-fa0e9b7add16\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c0954e7b-dbf9-4096-8d46-7d8eeea60b22\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>오라클 성장에 작용하는 3대 ‘가속 엔진’\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-712c04df-fdae-44d2-aa49-a30bf256334b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-3bd163e2-798b-43e1-a92a-3107430053cf\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8584a756-83aa-4385-9e9f-1693fcd98daa\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>클라우드 전환 가속\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9688e287-cff6-4d99-bcbf-15e81655543c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 OCI와 SaaS 포트폴리오 확대, 매출 구성비 30%→40% 목표.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e8206079-7a0a-4103-98b5-51a4add12488\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6545431f-c019-4852-a206-7931f46595cc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-826b086c-60ab-4a52-a85e-4af9d0f0b235\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>AI·데이터베이스 혁신\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fe905415-4e45-4399-85c3-68f430c22473\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 GenAI 기반 Autonomous DB 출시, 고마진 및 고객 확대 효과.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f4a02b3a-9441-4402-892a-9ba60d3e58e1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-efc28def-8053-4b48-bfef-abf3cf061d64\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2749 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cc024f9c-ab5e-4848-9deb-a361a1350ce5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>글로벌 파트너십\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d54fb359-f31a-4c1f-becc-078003473aeb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 마이크로소프트·아마존 등과 공동 마케팅, 해외 매출 비중 45%→52% 목표(2025년).\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-07c43b0f-dbe3-499a-b76d-88b49e322f7d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-572e5687-6e19-4ba3-bc12-ec11624a81cd\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4b54a2f3-e7ed-4d79-b9c5-ee59822307ab\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1fafbb4e-9647-41fd-aa67-186303d60857\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>시장 흐름과 향후 시나리오\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-32ecde16-0261-41c8-a7fd-80dec637347a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f80c7a5a-4e35-420b-bb1d-636955eaca12\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 베이스라인: 클라우드 매출 연평균 20% 성장, RPO 지속 개선 → 연간 주가 15~20% 상승 기대.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-fb544328-9c8f-4049-90e2-09cdd74cf9c3\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7645d799-7d38-428b-856e-070b72bdc91b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b 긍정적 변동: AI 수요 급증, 글로벌 IT 지출 회복 → 주가 30% 이상 상승 가능.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a095629b-1a09-4bdf-a323-6370bb2152b9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-816a28b4-2306-456d-b3e0-da5907487ac8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742 리스크 시나리오: 경기 둔화·금리 상승 시 RPO 감소 위험, 주가 5~10% 조정 가능성.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-48509bb6-9969-485b-8340-43c5551e294f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c9147053-c8c8-48c0-9fc3-99e5207124a5\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4756d6eb-71ce-4fbc-9343-e6369424cc9c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d123ea8c-b16e-4179-866e-83c9e668ecde\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>참고: 현재 시장 상황 빠르게 훑어보기\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-482b896c-16bc-493d-8a01-1d7b7673d7ca\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b929e970-b8ac-4fcd-9710-06a9c5fdbfb8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 KOSPI \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2b6d20d9-2060-4b6b-a579-8d3ac2585f69\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>5,609.95\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-13ad62cf-da3f-4995-9f5b-828d4b270241\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 국내 대형주 흐름\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-03dba37d-c516-4501-8a85-b3b9a3e5cd00\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-07776aeb-2804-4a68-a886-e7ea9f4daafa\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 KOSDAQ \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-246089f7-d845-4cae-87f4-72c95bc75e9b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1,136.83\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-eaa404cb-9372-404d-aa66-d7d8abd0d6cc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 기술·벤처 성장세\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-fe396ab4-9ff3-4c92-820e-e292d8acb588\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a457b6db-5183-4757-a84c-4a51addb7cab\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2732 S&amp;P500 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-581af7af-373a-4aa1-b1d8-2ff3fd1520bc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>109.19\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e8eca91c-ea85-42f1-8bfb-4b431890e5b0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 미국 대형주 경기 지표\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3261d855-768d-41fc-bc57-eba46b61f150\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f699ddea-e1ba-46b3-8952-4ed554de2ce1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 NASDAQ \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-91d4424e-9c6e-431b-8761-9d485ba5190b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>109.21\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-cfc859e9-78b5-4879-8707-413eaeda5791\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 미국 기술주 강세\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8614db63-f615-4da3-8934-d15bdc0fde69\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-cente