c1-8d98-209bbd09b584\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ed6bcda0-32ea-4d29-8d42-f5412af5d0ef\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8c26f186-e020-4b8a-b365-2314b4dad04e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>내일을 대비하는 투자 팁\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a4004f5f-11df-4d5f-8a2f-074868268c6a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9c7a3436-5990-438a-bc63-e4f545ff36a4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 구독형 매출 비중이 높은 기업(오라클, 마이크로소프트, 세일즈포스 등) 중심으로 포트폴리오 재편성.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8f92f85e-c3d3-4de4-88a4-03b897322c86\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-02f35b89-b9ef-4c44-b19c-2d3fe4d54c7f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742 달러 강세·환율 변동을 체크해 해외 매출 비중이 큰 IT 기업은 환위험 관리가 필수.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-158d3f17-61b0-461b-9ad1-411ea3e07f75\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7f224963-5887-4456-b2c8-f8740b8b4996\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d AI·클라우드 ESG·시나리오 보고서(예: Gartner, IDC) 활용해 성장 가시성을 검증.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-42442a3a-3e91-46cf-8c51-cd527a0ffcdc\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bf3c713d-035f-49df-9b4c-25f4c07171eb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 변동성 높은 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dde6fd24-39c8-44e3-8643-4608817b6433\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>비트코인·이더리움\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-34d6fd5b-1f14-447f-a3b1-a76a4f5ceff8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 대신 금 등 안전자산 비중을 조절해 전체 위험을 낮춤.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cee0d67c-11d7-4be3-93e7-c277c7cefc32\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d6da955f-2dea-40ca-bf0e-45b58a7597ac\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-341da302-9dbd-40ca-8d0e-31cb0e9fd1ca\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%98%88%EC%9D%80+%EC%9D%B4%EB%A3%A1-%EC%9D%80%EC%9A%A9%EC%84%9C%EB%8B%88%EC8%80+%EA%B0%80%EC%82%AC\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>앞으로의 투자 전략을 어떻게 구성하면 좋을까요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b2c0850e-e30f-4736-80a2-322de23f1e6a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5edbf432-7d28-44f7-9628-a5e0977476ff\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4d433fdb-33c7-453a-9076-949477d4bd03\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e3e0d3d6-3e67-4a56-a533-c658a9705519\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 마무리 \u2013 오라클이 보여준 실적·RPO 개선은 ‘클라우드·AI 전환 시대’에 필수적인 성장 엔진이 어떻게 작동하는지를 명확히 제시합니다. 지속 가능한 매출 구조와 글로벌 파트너십을 기반으로 투자 매력도가 높아지고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-632ef968-03d8-46d5-a1ed-96df1562a374\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9bc5fe2f-682b-49d7-9784-f1618fa3510e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-47fc5cb7-5bad-4081-9815-a73ca2790f0a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7