86-e020-4b8a-b365-2314b4dad04e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>내일을 대비하는 투자 팁\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a4004f5f-11df-4d5f-8a2f-074868268c6a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9c7a3436-5990-438a-bc63-e4f545ff36a4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 구독형 매출 비중이 높은 기업(오라클, 마이크로소프트, 세일즈포스 등) 중심으로 포트폴리오 재편성.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8f92f85e-c3d3-4de4-88a4-03b897322c86\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-02f35b89-b9ef-4c44-b19c-2d3fe4d54c7f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742 달러 강세·환율 변동을 체크해 해외 매출 비중이 큰 IT 기업은 환위험 관리가 필수.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-158d3f17-61b0-461b-9ad1-411ea3e07f75\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7f224963-5887-4456-b2c8-f8740b8b4996\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d AI·클라우드 ESG·시나리오 보고서(예: Gartner, IDC) 활용해 성장 가시성을 검증.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-42442a3a-3e91-46cf-8c51-cd527a0ffcdc\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center se-is-text-paragraph-block-selected\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bf3c713d-035f-49df-9b4c-25f4c07171eb\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 변동성 높은 \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dde6fd24-39c8-44e3-8643-4608817b6433\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>비트코인·이더리움\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-34d6fd5b-1f14-447f-a3b1-a76a4f5ceff8\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 대신 금 등 안전자산 비중을 조절해 전체 위험을 낮춤.\u003