" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2726 Hammer가 ‘Full Effect’ 신제품 볼링볼을 공개했습니다!\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-14b5be2f-667f-40e5-86e5-d69ca9427974\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-eef13c35-85cf-4c51-b535-e707ce69d377\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">볼링을 사랑하시는 여러분께 새롭게 다가올 혁신의 물결을 전하고 싶어 이렇게 인사드립니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-36198880-0338-44c0-8bd5-019fcc0d1a25\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-95a603a8-c82b-4614-93cd-461a080a946a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-32449336-c381-4ee2-878a-536716231f7d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b3d7c41d-89d1-400f-9a90-fb72df90b1e2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>왜 “Full Effect”가 주목받고 있나요?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7a193467-2bc6-4fb4-b988-7290694f5df8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2e7abc21-8660-4b4f-8dbd-add43b190be3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Hammer는 최신 다중\u2011위상 레진 코어와 3중 레이어 구조를 적용해 스피드·스핀과 정밀·안정성을 동시에 잡았습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0b77e627-97c8-4210-9ad0-72c51253dd7c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7a4cbe91-758c-4d2b-b65d-7c9bd0c7d300\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=Full%20Effect%20%EB%B3%BC%EB%A7%81%20%EC%8B%A0%EC%A0%9C%ED%92%88%20%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95%20%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%87%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>Full Effect 볼링 신제품의 특징은 무엇인가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-22f91b0d-33c7-49cb-b285-59ec1c8c9dea\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> 라는 질문을 많이 받는데, 답은 바로 “한 볼로 두 가지 샷을 구사한다”는 점입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0d697957-e5a3-4e37-beb4-6e0b5903603d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-388ec69f-0be5-4d25-9c92-919b90d23e88\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a9b8267a-af23-4fbb-af45-595ca44bb6a4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9520fc45-ca20-4587-9186-48c2b491eb58\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>실전 테스트 로드맵\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-51019d1c-41cb-4eb8-bae2-4d6eea9bfd83\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5c02196e-1959-49f7-9e24-415c849c1095\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2727 스포츠 샷(고속·스핀)과 하우스 샷(정밀·안정) 두 축을 동시에 검증하는 테스트가 진행됩니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-fb66f521-e5f7-4e64-9fee-d3d45b9e084d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d5f6a6b2-1da4-45ca-886f-2bcbbc34a09d\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">· 스포츠 샷 : 프로 토너먼트 현장에서 2주간 1,200개 샷 분석\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7d509d5b-621e-475d-86cd-2ee9b574aac5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7a450f92-79e5-4fc2-850c-7cf3f500e48e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">· 하우스 샷 : 전국 20개 볼링센터에서 레인·핀수 정확도 측정\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-818a2023-32c7-4506-a6d3-b480c91e8eff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8e0eccd5-7626-4d4d-8cae-6a10eb33adc9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%B3%BC%EB%A7%81%20%EC%8B%A4%EC%A0%84%20%ED%85%8C%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%20%EC%9D%BC%EC%A0%95%20%EC%96%B4%EB%94%94%EC%84%9C%20%EB%B3%BC%EC%88%98%20%EC%9E%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>볼링 실전 테스트는 어디서 진행되나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4043011a-6dd5-42af-8a69-100ddae47d00\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2652df93-6edc-4b16-889f-76b40e351a24\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ce08ccd2-4e1f-411b-ab9a-1d3385369bb2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a8b1414f-24b9-423e-beda-eefd742cad45\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>주요 연결 고리\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-785bb47d-4dfc-4046-b569-b8ca633dafe2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c82c3c9b-6656-4ed9-a213-356f9f589912\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 거시 경제 상황이 다소 불안정해도 레저·스포츠는 ‘심리 방어선’ 역할을 합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-252808c1-2384-4901-a3f2-d7719d5fecd5\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0d587f80-5c49-40d9-9d03-aa8a56f983b0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">· KOSPI·KOSDAQ 상승 → 고가 스포츠 장비 구매 여력 증가\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a544f575-cb74-4cd3-a984-a8928482adf2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-bdfd7180-0eb6-4d79-8c3a-da25c97b33c3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">· 글로벌 공급망 회복 → 레진·코어 원가 10~15% 절감 예상\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b96d18fd-8bf0-4a27-b137-c75b01fede85\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fe1ffc59-8cf9-4802-890b-6487e587ba9a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">· 데이터·AI 기반 코칭 서비스가 곧 확대될 전망입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-351f3052-adce-4212-87d4-7299462f148c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0f4f4666-d735-4dd0-93e7-b22b016c8fe9\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e635fe09-ca47-4966-8ce0-f2743c807c6e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ffad7992-10c2-4919-b2df-5ec4a98c503f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>트렌드 정리 &amp; 앞으로의 기대\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a02fcc77-ac31-488d-879b-5b1a4362a672\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0088d74e-b058-4e69-a7d4-6a2f18b40452\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 데이터·AI와 볼링의 결합 \u2013 QR\u2011코드 스캔으로 전용 앱에서 스윙·스코어를 자동 분석합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d34fe7b3-3c97-41d4-aac6-1f525c9817ca\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8e48ec5-2ace-47b8-a305-1d45298f9bb6\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 멀티\u2011레인·멀티\u2011스킬 대응 \u2013 무게·핸드레버 교체만으로 다양한 레인에 맞춤 사용이 가능합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3909bafd-a7f3-4aad-bcb2-ca7d322a71c9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6fcd66df-3743-4503-aeaa-9d8a21c1aff1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 글로벌 공급망 회복 \u2013 레진·코어 원가가 낮아져 가격 경쟁력이 상승합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-500a7aef-5b1a-405a-8264-342c9f1cf2d9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fe380a71-3424-4273-848f-f53ca49d5ae9\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2729 커뮤니티·콘텐츠 마케팅 \u2013 유튜버·인플루언서와 협업한 실전 영상이 바이럴 파장을 일으키고 있습니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2ebe83ff-6c6f-4e79-a082-47b7d1b3f231\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-04848fd4-2a7d-4ae1-afcf-b6ff51761f90\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2fffad5a-db0b-40c7-b4df-d0ffdf07eaf7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c96c5e9e-f1c1-4b2f-a4f9-7e88f9a95fa7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>결론 \u2013 “Full Effect”는 무엇을 의미하는가?\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-66b2bb7a-10ec-45fa-ad56-8c5f63edec20\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-4ec74bb9-2681-4e70-937c-e85f77c808da\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d Hammer는 이번 출시를 통해 단순 신제품을 넘어, 볼링 산업을 “데이터 기반·다목적” 시대로 전환하고자 합니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-754111bd-f4d9-40f2-a3ec-9a01cb44c86a\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a483f71e-c7e9-4a90-8cb3-94a20c910d1b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">플레이어는 하나의 볼로 스포츠·하우스 샷 모두를 즐길 수 있게 되며, 시장 확대와 신규 유저 확보가 가속화될 것입니다.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-93e64fde-20c9-410d-87ee-a0b0a2c941ad\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-11d8ce7c-b366-431f-877a-80f98caccf75\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a1209ab9-f788-440c-8328-08a866ee8a58\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7c648d12-37b0-4988-9e61-b07dc5b04c08\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>여러분이 할 수 있는 액션\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f840fd9c-7524-4ba6-a59a-356f3c17944d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-45defdd9-54b6-49d8-9463-f48d03a15458\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d8103b5e-1e15-4498-a1e8-54ee58619803\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=Hammer%20%EB%B3%BC%EB%A7%81%20%EA%B3%B5%EC%8B%9D%20%EC%9C%A0%ED%8A%9C%EB%B8%8C%20%EC%B1%84%EB%84%90%20%EA%B5%AC%EB%8F%85%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>Hammer 공식 유튜브 채널 구독하기\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9c1f9dbb-4b1f-440c-a19e-7a5e74048bdc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> \u2013 최신 테스트 영상과 팁을 받아보세요.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0c1eb667-d2ee-4eba-a93d-71bfa0f1dffd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-efee43df-0466-4681-b4f1-3a197ec1706b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0e0d1168-3fb1-4608-bda8-95fbee307d33\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=Full%20Effect%20%EC%95%B1%20%EB%8B%A4%EC%9A%B4%EB%A1%9C%EB%93%9C%20%EB%B0%A9%EB%B2%95\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>‘Full Effect’ 전용 코칭 앱 다운로드\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d85a3c68-6b32-4062-b0e4-ed2b85db1d97\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" styl