e\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>오늘의 핵심 \u2013 “이란\u2011이스라엘 군사 대립 격화, 호르무즈·중동 전역에 불안 파동”\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2b6df513-cf25-4fcb-9f81-ed510f939681\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f1540757-997a-4976-9839-8157f0c7b5da\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-22cc3877-e882-4529-bc38-70def54575d2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b126f5ab-fb4d-4e83-b6c2-71d2f7852241\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>\u2726 최근 이란과 이스라엘 사이에 군사·외교 긴장이 급격히 고조되고 있습니다. \u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1b40c31f-4e23-404d-88b5-16a5e4fad117\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%9D%B4%EB%9E%80%EA%B3%BC%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC%EC%97%98%20%EA%B5%B0%EC%82%AC%20%EB%8C%80%EB%A6%BD%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%8B%AC%ED%99%94%EB%90%90%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\u003Cb>왜 이란\u2011이스라엘 군사 대립이 심화됐나요?\u003C/b>\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-35cc404c-9ec1-4987-8674-4e683fbb255c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e58fe9fc-9b72-4aef-a36b-585f7d56b2dd\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-75bf43de-2035-48c4-8b84-d063073588ee\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a682e921-4a81-40c0-b676-df614b3983f1\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>\u2727 호르무즈 해협은 전 세계 석유 수출의 약 20%가 통과하는 ‘생명선’으로, 여기서 발생하는 혼선은 해운·에너지 시장에 큰 충격을 줍니다. \u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f1c29987-78d6-4fc5-a731-64939a771396\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%98%B8%EB%A5%B4%EB%AC%B4%EC%A6%88%20%ED%95%B4%ED%98%91%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%A4%91%EC%9A%94%ED%95%9C%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>\u003Cb>호르무즈 해협이 왜 중요한가요?\u003C/b>\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b4f273f3-e4eb-4230-be9d-adfdca102fa4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-231d9ea2-b98a-43e9-8316-84be78efde94\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f934ac75-205c-498a-89c9-0e7ddc91e53d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b305ae8e-430c-48ae-9edd-bc911eb998a3\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>\u2729 이 지역에서 발생하는 군사 충돌은 석유·가스 공급 차질을 초래하고, 전 세계 원자재·에너지 가격 상승을 야기합니다. \u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3b425354-83cd-4bbb-8170-5ba1796a0c73\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6e867a57-7cf1-4a1a-933e-bf6891e52ebb\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cbc01e4c-17b8-42ae-b1c1-c36dd234277f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8aeb920c-d992-4b61-a058-2d0d622b36c5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>\u272a 또한, 주변 국가들의 인프라(드론·미사일 공격 대상)와 전력·정유 설비 파괴 위험도 커지고 있습니다. \u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2eb45c2d-2053-4dec-a6fe-bf594e580501\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-37a363a8-ae10-48b5-8da4-f08c855c15ce\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-13d1561a-a3a2-4389-8f79-cfe35c24dee2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6299f3c1-5eac-4941-9fd9-9f1e00df2830\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>\u272b\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f60046ff-8f7d-465c-8051-ec4f96ce1ac8\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fadfe70c-9078-4f16-b7d1-0fcfe860f896\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-692ebae3-715b-481d-a7f2-643cca77486c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0184e32e-4d4a-48be-af4f-564ada3081d4\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cb18fd73-4cd4-4989-b67d-69241d694ab2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7ffc71fe-a76d-485a-95d9-afb2f1055076\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d67a5336-683b-440c-a7b3-f8bbbad4efa1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a5767896-226a-4e05-80bc-4d235c6b9d08\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>1\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-053f8162-330d-4920-ac50-06b57f875033\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 상황 정리 \u2013 “왜 지금, 왜 호르무즈인가?”\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1563f695-1e2f-40f2-a8d3-25aba5e01c83\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9381b5e5-015e-4b22-9cbf-c66bc7596a69\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-201ba695-a4b9-413d-9bbd-3922c6ff5169\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-261d52ff-9019-426a-a0a6-0443ec7c4e46\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272d 군사적 대립 심화 \u2013 이란이 이스라엘 대사관을 향해 무인기·미사일을 발사하고, 이스라엘은 이란 해군 기지를 공습했습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8dc16be3-03dd-431d-9e82-2a4af7012ec7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%9D%B4%EB%9E%80%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4%EB%9D%BC%EC%97%98%20%EB%AC%B4%EC%9D%B8%EA%B8%B0%20%EB%B0%9C%EC%82%AC%20%EC%99%9C%20%EC%9D%BC%EC%96%B4%EB%82%98%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 이란이 무인기를 발사했나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a52b0c0c-2955-4ff4-ae7f-3c473b28fda9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-dc6ecc8a-2eb7-4838-a9f0-5d0439a6a050\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e1b9d50d-d314-40b8-96a2-565598b7b60e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-741fb5da-b544-4ff9-ac58-160e7c5a646c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 호르무즈 해협의 전략적 거리 \u2013 양측의 언쟁이 격화되면서 이 해협을 둘러싼 군사 행동이 급증하고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a46433c7-e286-458a-9c5b-61236d629eeb\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1127f305-1c24-4028-888b-c95fa429b5bf\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b5391a29-5e79-48c5-9aa0-fc017da8b347\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a1582101-0290-473c-b95a-ef02c7ef6dd7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f 해상 혼선·운송 차질 \u2013 전 세계 석유 수출량의 약 20%가 지나가는 이곳에서 선박 통행 제한과 보험료 상승이 예상됩니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-82970708-c208-495b-a985-d751f62a1249\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%98%B8%EB%A5%B4%EB%AC%B4%EC%A6%88%20%ED%95%B4%ED%98%91%20%EC%84%A0%EB%B0%95%20%ED%86%B5%ED%96%89%20%EC%A0%9C%ED%95%9C%20%EC%9D%B4%EC%9C%A0\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>호르무즈에서 선박 통행 제한은 왜 생기나요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4888b8ac-38c1-42d6-9c26-a8eda422a51f\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e800cdbe-04f8-4b18-9cbb-602f796d9b87\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ecb47a1b-8922-4bff-a455-1f88dd8a6ea0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8f6cf34d-fa65-4970-86e6-eb49a7ae09c0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 중동 인프라 공격 \u2013 아랍에미리트·사우디 등 주요 석유·가스 시설이 드론·미사일 표적이 되고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cba67dca-85f3-44b5-9bbb-ea75820b37ae\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e3f7c093-629f-4910-b08c-99d85b9075c4\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-76b7a457-5e67-42d1-9a36-c5d3c1e61bb4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e0e30ef5-23e7-48a7-90a3-7a6c7f6e947b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2740\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ca79ee4d-39a7-43b9-8468-d51f30e768bf\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b8e58f57-6639-44e7-8410-2d4800190626\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-80711abb-3c4f-4a3b-adf0-179cc7a346ff\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-93e9b4a8-81ec-4e91-b1aa-4729d9621437\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a28a454c-06c9-4def-867f-a62e06fd0c0b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-af3861aa-8e00-4424-8df0-e3bb0d824c68\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5b7e3e2b-08c3-4f19-b5ba-57624401ec0b\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fdb3007d-5cc4-489b-8b0a-acdc38cf44d1\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>2\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-22b941b0-9875-4a08-875b-72d2852b2b4a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 시장·경제적 파급 \u2013 “다시 보이는 ‘경제 지표와 전쟁’의 연결 고리”\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b2af0289-1687-468d-85b1-e3b38966ce2e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b6c6e811-72e1-4ee8-a474-2a918467a7d3\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-0bcc5d44-4a45-498b-963e-4fc6d28f01b1\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-36267382-3217-48ff-afde-9a63540dbf90\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 원자재·에너지 가격 상승 \u2013 석유·가스 가격 급등으로 한국의 에너지·화학 기업 매출이 늘어나지만, 수출 경기 위축 위험도 동반됩니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ab28dc74-b4ae-4e2a-9695-01b1530c1a9e\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%84%9D%EC%9C%A0%20%EA%B0%80%EA%B2%A9%20%EC%83%81%EC%8A%B9%20%ED%95%9C%EA%B5%AD%20%EA%B8%B0%EC%97%85%EC%97%90%20%EB%AF%B8%EC%B9%98%EB%8A%94%20%EC%98%81%ED%96%A5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>석유 가격 상승이 한국 기업에 미치는 영향은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-ff2a0ecd-9945-4d26-a186-5060efbc5f13\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1d39285f-6d77-47a0-aa32-a5fdf61339b8\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cf489270-9378-4142-b971-c6ef8533c928\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-73a9410c-c2be-4e9a-a434-d0fc6014a50c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2732 글로벌 주식·채권·디지털 자산 \u2013 전쟁 위험 프리미엄과 에너지 가격 상승으로 금·비트코인 등 안전·대안 자산 수요가 늘어나고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-d4e9870a-5d9d-4515-bd8a-6f7034d1bd52\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-e0868f26-202b-47f0-9b36-8548be349341\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-cf0f2926-c423-464f-b6ab-59066e4b61d0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f0b2c14d-06db-49c7-8339-29d3729becd2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2733 달러 강세·원화 약세 \u2013 미국 금리 인상과 안전 자산 선호로 달러가 강세를 보이며 원화는 약세를 기록하고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-97fb48c1-1fdd-496c-9fc7-f651410f2e35\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EB%8B%AC%EB%9F%AC%20%EA%B0%95%EC%84%B8%20%EC%9B%90%ED%99%94%20%EC%95%BD%EC%84%B8%20%EC%99%9C%20%EB%B0%9C%EC%83%9D%ED%96%88%EB%82%98%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>왜 달러가 강세이고 원화가 약세인가요?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8e8d90a4-18a8-4510-803f-fb82aaadf0b9\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-069f37b1-dc99-49b6-b6be-f8a4421b6d55\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-840983b9-c638-4b15-ab71-0da9a558ae30\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1931e583-e8bb-4d66-bfb7-396b4f637bd5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2741\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e111c9c5-dbbe-44d7-9cd1-40188ce24b64\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-fecde4ae-b746-4269-960a-0cf80a81fea0\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-df400eb2-95ae-4884-b3c8-752cb06a7dab\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-c97b2255-8832-4b23-acb6-192ddd37e7de\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-3d8269cf-7c10-4a73-9dfb-6609e9732213\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-801317f2-9b44-4ba0-8dc3-ef623dc1c527\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-1e6793ef-d42f-4494-b10b-08735aa4c361\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-9e1606b3-44eb-48bc-a5e8-9c7e78d33cbb\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>3\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-478b22b3-1f30-4e1b-b18e-d718a262c2b4\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 트렌드 &amp; 인사이트 \u2013 “전쟁이 만든 새로운 투자 테마”\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-550ec889-226d-454f-a397-1a348fd9243c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a765be0a-7f3e-4b0e-86cb-aae00ba1cc2e\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b4138896-809e-4349-8539-58edc44164e7\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-16e29382-5d90-4dab-aa4d-f152697a7060\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2736 에너지 안보 강화 \u2013 석유·가스 공급 차단 위험으로 재생에너지·전기차 배터리 관련 기업에 투자 가속이 흐르고 있습니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-534b8445-1a9d-4fba-b469-b2544d2100dc\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-a0693673-039e-4d32-b5c1-8fa845b21188\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4dbe1fba-03e9-47e8-9470-248f89d0985d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-90dd2bbf-e5e9-4664-9ecb-fff095a77e5f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2737 방위·안보 산업 급부상 \u2013 전쟁 위험으로 방위산업 매출이 확대될 전망이며, 관련 ETF와 방산주에 관심이 집중됩니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-21ade5b5-e141-4611-bfeb-b93408b9a50c\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-06a98276-a6ae-4f6e-a221-966fda1d14d6\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-83cd4c61-dc98-42c9-aeeb-6f091af52c56\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-092686b2-dded-4355-b9a5-e3a69d132149\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2738 리스크 헤지 자산 확대 \u2013 금·비트코인 등 ‘안전·대안’ 자산 비중을 늘리고, 포트폴리오 내 귀금속·디지털 자산을 5~10% 수준으로 조정하는 전략이 유효합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0d250ffe-544d-4b49-8e8e-0e2c62087e2c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%EC%A0%84%EC%9F%81%20%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%81%AC%20%ED%97%A4%EC%A7%80%20%ED%88%AC%EC%9E%90%20%EC%A0%84%EB%9E%B5\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>전쟁 시 리스크 헤지 투자 전략은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4ef343da-a0e8-4778-88f8-bf5523710910\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-ffcaa7f6-2f06-4495-9513-abfbc0097771\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-93c9824b-b791-4503-a8c6-afed5f2f7dcd\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2ba54ef5-d74d-47cd-bf3e-b648891e486c\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2739 물류·해운 프리미엄 \u2013 호르무즈·수에즈 혼란으로 해운 운임과 보험료가 상승하며, 물류·해운 기업의 단기 수익 개선 가능성이 부각됩니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-07e0f25c-8062-4ba7-a7e1-cb85f80b7650\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8110b9eb-0caf-49ca-b969-1cba936b9742\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-7183fb68-8520-4548-870f-3f0a39fa58bf\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f025cf88-5073-489d-bc8a-72b33fcc737f\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2742\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c13bc4f6-c112-4627-bd35-250ff1d80e61\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-031c1c8f-9033-4f68-922f-b5e3f72f8561\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-301b9026-ff73-4fbe-bf92-c7b30cb19102\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-2eb36914-2a54-48d7-8679-7f3e575db49b\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c0e90b7b-9b4e-49a4-be33-d792f8197643\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-7bdf3ab0-c665-4fc1-8575-c317b86ad81f\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2351bb24-7d2a-46ef-a9e4-9aafd6a3a3a6\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6c680e8a-a199-4a55-8d4e-b3c0236d6351\" class=\"se-emoji se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>4\ufe0f\u20e3\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-802750e9-bfd3-46ba-abcd-3a18ddc5cda0\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb> 결론 \u2013 “불확실성 속에서 ‘안전·성장’ 전략은?”\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-40af5ee0-bd9e-4dfa-8038-1c518489279d\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5b7799f3-f352-42a5-9273-3b8ff8be9f1a\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-afdf090c-5b37-4868-b1e0-0c8d2fd77976\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-15ff1186-ef1c-46cf-910e-550e5efc1b32\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272a 핵심 위험 \u2013 호르무즈 해협 차단·석유 공급 위기는 단기 유가 급등과 전 세계 공급망 교란을 초래합니다. \u003C/span>\u003Cspan id=\"SE-460d67c1-4556-4d17-a49d-d2907520431a\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 se-link __se-node\" data-href=\"https://search.naver.com/search.naver?query=%ED%98%B8%EB%A5%B4%EB%AC%B4%EC%A6%88%20%ED%95%B4%ED%98%91%20%EC%B0%A8%EB%8B%A8%20%EC%9C%84%ED%97%98%EC%9D%80%20%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%87%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%80%EC%9A%94\" style=\"color: rgb(13, 110, 253);\">\u003Cu>호르무즈 해협 차단 위험은?\u003C/u>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-af9872d3-81fe-429b-984d-619929545903\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-f8a7f90c-ef23-4fe3-9778-419712de87a5\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9477737a-ea9f-4143-9930-798645fd6e69\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-176dc544-88a2-480e-980e-30e66ae37d81\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272b 시사점 \u2013 투자자는 에너지·방위·안전 자산 비중을 확대하고, 환위험·물류비 상승에 대비하는 것이 현명합니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-9f22ef79-eb10-434d-af3b-eb10348df4b0\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6dc92ba8-d3f4-43f4-96d2-06adb942fb02\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-2dde1d07-36d2-4c89-be6a-6eb5ffff1543\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-5929dd9d-957d-4fe1-8bea-ed3efa93923b\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272e 전망 \u2013 현재 상황이 ‘전략적 교착 상태’라면 지속적인 긴장이 시장 전반에 불안정성을 확대할 가능성이 높습니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e70301a0-163d-4d2c-91ec-0f56b4f29763\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-6286a96c-81c9-4823-a003-2a2c79351130\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8ede2216-3cfb-4967-ba3e-7665c0396880\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-0b34d525-7227-43a0-8f1c-2ceb24a9c584\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u272f 전략 \u2013 방위·재생에너지·안전 자산 포트폴리오 확대와 함께 환헤지·물류 비용 관리를 병행하면 안정적인 성장 기대가 가능합니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-f5ec3717-248b-43a7-9bd1-b95e9f441b52\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-125694a8-bc94-4c8a-9994-b42a1dca23e0\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-8da91df4-9651-4271-a50a-6cdacd357262\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-8945a414-35bf-4c07-a64c-dd0b233a91f5\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2730 마지막 한 마디 \u2013 “불안정은 언제나 새로운 투자 기회를 동반합니다.” 이번 이란\u2011이스라엘 군사 대립이 장기적인 안보·에너지 패러다임 변화를 이끌지, 단기 파동에 그칠지는 앞으로의 흐름을 지켜봐야 합니다. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c8ddde74-367c-4213-ba04-11e17f4457b2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-59029a4f-d1d8-4946-b9e5-a68c33f30818\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-56a5f70e-d72d-49fb-976e-b6577c3bf9af\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 1.2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-424aec27-22e3-447b-a57a-c6a571d6a0c7\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u003Cb>더 읽어볼 만한 기사 &amp; 보고서\u003C/b>\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-4ecc24bb-7d3f-4517-8cba-3e2c6c674695\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-1049bbc9-fc2e-4fb3-a5ef-b7c6ad7abad9\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-c8c9195f-b7e7-4cbe-81a1-ca7447390da2\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-29970eb5-f9bb-4980-ab6b-3a8a186fc3fa\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2731 “호르무즈 해협, 세계 에너지 흐름의 병목” \u2013 블룸버그 (해협 차단 시 1일 석유 공급 손실 $2~3억 추산) \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-22415956-1b0b-49a9-a9b8-5907933646d4\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-db15c53a-7dc8-443a-b261-1603e0073ee3\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-5763691b-b538-4972-b4cc-31b8ae5f4f18\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-b1a17fc0-2ae4-49d7-930c-5dcda4b52afc\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2732 “중동 군사 갈등과 글로벌 금리 정책” \u2013 IMF 워킹 페이퍼 (지정학 리스크가 금리 인상 사이클에 미치는 영향) \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-a93b4ba4-fe44-44e8-a9a9-9a113e821f11\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-78610186-24d8-447a-ae27-8d2898cc893c\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-42f04ff7-fc41-472f-b6bd-9cd10a24d55e\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-12d0f190-d177-4cdc-8fcb-586de17ed1e2\" class=\"se-ff-system se-fs13 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">\u2733 “디지털 자산, 전쟁 위험 프리미엄” \u2013 코인마켓캡 리서치 (전쟁·테러 발생 시 비트코인 거래량 급증 사례) \u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-b4efc9d9-5945-4f1f-97e4-ecff9461a516\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003Cspan id=\"SE-d140a8a5-dbac-4d6b-82e0-4fd9582323df\" class=\"se-ff-nanumgothic se-fs19 __se-node\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\u003Cp id=\"SE-e397a429-9004-4aeb-a5f6-9d86e3da0724\" class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align-center\" style=\"line-height: 2;\">\u003